    // The hard-set: up to N examples per cell.
    "hard": [
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Ubushyuhe burashobora kugabanuka hafi 0,6 ° C kuri metero 100 z'uburebure kandi imvura ikiyongera mugihugu, I bujumbura umurwa mukuru w'ubutunzi, mu burengerazuba bw'igihugu ndetse no ku nkombe z'ikiyaga cya Tanganyika, hakunda gushuha niyo aba ari murushana. Ubushyuhe bwumunsi burashuha cane umwaka wose, hafi 30 ° C. Ubushuhe bworoheje burashobora kugera hafi 18 ° C k'umwaka wose. Imvura igwa buri mwaka igera kuri milimetero 800, cank metero 0.8. Imvura iragwa cane kuva mu kwicenda gushika muri nzero, ikanabandanya gushika mukwezi kwa gatanu canke mumpera zukwakane. Muri Nyanza-Lac, mu majepfo ashira uburengerazuba bw'Uburundi ndetse no ku nkombe z'ikiyaga ca Tanganyika, ubushuhe burasa cane n'ubw'umurwa mukuru w'ubutunzi. I Gitega kumurwa mukuru w'igihugu c'U Burundi, ubushyuhe ntarengwa (bityo kumurango) burashusha (hafi ya 25 ° C), Mwijoro (hafi 13 ° C). Igihe cimvura naco kirakomeye kuruta mu murwa mukuru w'ubutunzi." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Igihe c'ici igihe bizwi ko haba ubushuhe cane kurusha ibindi bihe kuko nico gihe imvura itagwa canke ishobora kugwa 1 Mu Kwezi. N'igihe gikunda gutangura muri Ruheshi(6) kigahera muri myandagaro (8) aho ubushuhe bushobora gushika hagati ya 17°C na 29°C." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Ariko muri ico gihe nyene, imvura iratangura, iboneka muburyo bwimvura y imiravyo myinshi, kandi buhoro buhoro iyo mvura iragabanya ubushuhe, bikagarura ibitigiri vyanditswe mugihe kiba gisigaye cumwaka, ni ukuvuga nka dogere 22/25 ku mutaga mu kiyaya, no hafi ya 27/28 ° C mu biyaya vyo mu burengero." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Umurwa mukuru, Bujumbura, uherereye ku nkombe z'ikiyaga. Aho hama hashushe umwaka wose, ariko ntibirenza urugero, kubera ko ubushuhe ntarengwa buri hagati ya dogere 29 hafi yumwaka wose, nubwo bugera kuri 30/31 ° C kuva hagati muri Myandagaro kugeza muri Gitugutu." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Ikirere co muri ako karere kirashushe. Ubushuhe bwo mu mwaka muri y ni 17 °C . Ukwezi gushushe cane ni Nzero, aho ubushuhe bushika 20 °C, kandi igihe gikanye cane ni Mukakaro, kikaba gifise 16 °C ." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Ibi bikunda kubaho iyo indege iri kure Cane mukirere kuburebure burenga imetero 8000 (ni ukuvuga nka kilometero 8 uvuye hasi), ahaba hagera ubushuhe bwinshi (humidity) kandi hakaba hakonje cane (nko munsi ya -39°C). Ico gihe amazi aba asohotse mu mashini z’indege ahinduka urubura buhoro buhoro, bigatuma haboneka iyo mirongo yera." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Uruzi rwa Nasia ruherereye mu buraruko bwa Ghana hagati y’imirongo y’akarere iri hagati ya 9°55' na 10°40' mu buraruko hamwe na 1°05' mu burengero na 0°15' mu buseruko. Rukomoka ku guhurira hamwe kw’utugezi tune dutoduto two mu misozi yo muri ako karere. Inyuma y’aho, rutembera rugana mu burengero gushika aho rwinjira muri White Volta." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Abanyagihugu: 12.100.000 (2019) muri iyi myaka mirongo itatu iheze igitigiri c’abantu caraduze incuro kabiri;" },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Ukwikukira: Ku wa mbere Mukakaro 1962 (01/07/1962); (vyakozwe n'Umuganwa Ludoviko GWAGASORE nawe akaba yarasanzwe ari UMUGANWA: umuganwa ni umwana w'umwami)" },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Abashakashatsi bavuga ko Uburundi bwamyeho nk'igihugu cikwiye kuva mu kinjana ca 16. Mu mwaka w'1903 niho catakaza intahe y’ukwikukira igihe hashikiye abadagi; umwami w’ico gihe Mwezi Gisabo akaba yasinyanye nabo Amasezerano y’i Kiganda. Haheze ingwano ya mbere y’isi yose caciye gicurwa bufuni na buhoro n'igihugu c’Ububirigi. Uburundi bwarafatanijwe n’igihugu c'Urwanda: Rwanda-Urundi. Ku wa 1 Mukakaro 1962 niho igihugu c'Uburundi casubira kuronka intahe yaco y'ukwikukira irondewe n'umuganwa Rwagasore Rudoviko umuhungu w'umwami Mwambutsa Bangiricenge akaba n'umukuru w’umugambwe w'Abadasigana UPRONA. Uburundi cari igihugu cifashe kandi cagutse. Mu nyuma ku ntwaro y'Ababirigi gitakaza Ubugufi, imwe mu ntara yari nini, ica yegukira igihugu ca Tanzaniya." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Kuva Uburundi buronse ukwikukira, bwagize ingorane nyinshi zijanye n’ivy'imibano na poritike zagumye zigaruka ari zo zatumye haba indwano, haba abahungiye mu mahanga abandi bakegeranirizwa hagati mu gihugu, harasamburwa inyubakwa rusangi n’ubutunzi. Ingwano yabaye mu Burundi mu 1993, niyo yabaye ndende cane kandi ni nayo yagize inkurikizi mbi cane ku vyerekeye poritike. Kukaba nkako, uretse ihagarikwa ry’umuzo w'intwaro rusangi n’itituka ry’ivyerekana iterambere mu vyerekeye ubutunzi ico kiza nyene c’intambara cateye, caranatumye haba itituka ry’ubutegetsi n’akaranga mu bice vyinshi vy’igihugu." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Inyuma y’ihagarikwa ry'intwaro rusangi mu 1993, ibihugu bigize kano karere (Ubuganda, Tanzaniya, Afirika y’epfo), bishigikiwe n’amakungu , vyarafashe ingingo yo kugarukana amahoro mu gihugu, ibiganiro vyatumye haba ishirwa ry’igikumu i Arusha ku masezerano y’amahoro n’umwumvikano mu Burundi. Amasezerano y’i Arusha ashimikiye ku mwumvikano n’ubumwe mu gihugu, agategekanya n’ingene abadasangiye ubwoko boserukirwa ata mahinyu. Ishirwa mu ngiro ry’Amasezerano ryabaye intango y’intwaro y’infatakibanza, mu ntambwe yashitseko iyihambaye ikaba yabaye ishikirizwa muri Gitugutu umwaka wa 2001, ry’ibwirizwa shingiro rigenga itunganywa ry’inzego mu kiringo c’amezi 36." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Muri Ruhuhuma umwaka wa 2005, Abarundi barahamagariwe kwemeza irindi bwirizwa shingiro biciye mu matora. Iryo bwirizwa shingiro risubirira iryamaze amezi 36, rirasigura neza ko Uburundi ari irepuburika yigenga, ifise intwaro rusangi kandi itisunga idini na rimwe , \" yubahiriza ubudasa bw’amoko n’amadini \". Iryo bwirizwa shingiro rirubahiriza urugero amoko aserukirwa mu vya poritike, mu nzego, mu buzi bwa reta, rikongera rikubahiriza intwaro ihuriyemwo abanyeporitike n’abajejwe umutekano mu gushinga urugero ahahutu n’abatutsi baserukirwako, badasize inyuma kwubahiriza uguserukirwa kw’abakenyezi ku bice 30%." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Uburundi ni igihugu gitunzwe canecane n´uburimyi hamwe n´ubworozi. Ibice mirongo icenda kw'ijana (90%) vy´abarundi nico bakora. Kuva mu 1993 aho ingwano itereye bifatanijwe n´ibihano bwafatiwe mu 1996 n´ibihugu bibanyi vyo kwugara imbibe; ubukene bwariyongereye cane. Ubu Uburundi buriko buranaganaga kuva aho hasinyiwe amasezerano hagati y'imigwi yahora irwanya ubutegetsi hamwe n'igisoda ca reta. Abahinga babona ko Uburundi bufise kazoza keza." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Rudoviko RWAGASORE yavutse itariki 10 nzero 1932 mu ntara ya Gitega. Yavyawe n'umwami MWAMBUTSA n´umwamikazi Tereza KANYONGA. Ahejeje kaminuza 1956 yaciye ataha i Burundi aca ashinga umugambwe UPRONA kugira ngo agwanye Ababirigi." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "\"Ishengero ry'ukuri rya Yesu\" ni ishengero ryigenga ryashizweho n'Umwami ubwiwe mu gisagara c'i Yerusaremu ryari rigizwe n'intumwa 12 n'abandi. IVYAKOZW 11:22 IVYAKOZW 9:31 ABAHEBURAYO 12:22/24. Ntaho tubona muri BIBIRIYA iryo mu gisagara ca Beijing kiri muri Chine mu gihumbi kimwe n'amajana icenda na cumi n'indwi (1917). Uyu musi, ugereranije, rifise abayoboke imiliyoni zibiri n'igice mu bihugu mirongo ine na bitanu no mu mpande z'isi yose uko ari zitandatu. Iryo shengero rikukira ishami ry'abakirisu b'abapentekoti ryabonye izuba mu kinjana ca mirongo ibiri. Intumbero yabo ni ukwigisha ubutumwa bwiza bw'agakiza mu mahanga yose imbere y'umuzo ugira kabiri wa Yesu Kristo. NAMBA KOKO CATEGORY YACU NGENDERWAKO Izi ngingo BIBIRIYA izivuga uku: Icambere uwizera akabatizwa umubatizo w'ukuri AZOKIZWA Mariko 16:16" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Blake Clark (* 2.2.1946, Macon, Georgia).Blake Clark n'umukinyi akongera akaba n'uwutegura filime afise ubwenegihugu bwa Amerika yavutse itariki 2/2/1946 i Macon muri Géorgie." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Igenekerezo rya 4/12/ 2015, Nkurunziza yategetse abapolisi kurondera abicanyi bishe Nshimirimana mu minsi icumi." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Igenekerezo rya 13/12/ 2016, abapolisi bo mu Burundi batangaje ko umwe mu bakekwa kuba barishe Nshimirimana yatorotse ibohero yica umuzamu." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Mu Burundi, igihugu ca Afrika giherereye mubumanuko bwa ekwateri. Hafi yigihugu cose kigizwe n imirima ku rugero rwa metero 1.500 / 1.800, ariko kandi, muburengero, umurongo wo hasi uherereye nko mu metero 800, n'uruhererekane rw imisozi." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Usivye amezi atatu y ici (Ruheshi, mukakaro na myandagaro), mu gihe gisigaye c'umwaka hagwa imvura igereranye; imvura ikunda kwiyongera kandi muri rusangi iranyengetera hafi mm 1,200 / 1,400 mm ku mwaka mu kiyaya, ariko ikamanuka musi ya mm 1.000 mukarere gashushe ko muburengero kandi kadafise imvura nyinshi mu gihugu. Muri kano gace dusangamwo ikiyaga ca Tanganyika. Ikiyaga kirorosha ikirere cane cane mwijoro, mugihe kumutaga gitera ubushuhe bukeya, n aho buzana umuyaga mwiza." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "SOSUMO, ni ihinguriro rihingura isukari rikongera rikanayidandaza.Ryashinzwe itariki ya 13/07/1982, uyu mwaka rikazoba rikwije imyaka 41 rivutse. Rihereye mu buseruko bw'igihugu neza na neza mu ntara ya RUTANA muri komine Gihofi,mu ntara kama ya KUMOSO.Rigishingwa ryatanguranye ama hegitari 5800,munyuma yararonse ayandi 1000 muzindi ntara bafadikanije nabanyagihugu.Amwe mumahangiro yihaye:-Gutezimbere ubutunzi mu buseruko bw'igihugu-Kuziganya amafaranga y'agaciro batarinze kugurisha isukari hanze y'igihuguIhinguriro SOSUMO rikaba riterera cane mu kigega no mw'iterambere ry'igihugu. Mukunzi Nsabimana Ken Blein (ikiyago) 19:09, 27 Ruhuhuma 2023 (UTC)" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Mu gihugu c'Uburundi igisagara ça Bujumbura kw'isoko rikuru riheruka gusha. Isoko rikuru rya Bujumbura riri hagati mu gisagara ca Bujumbura aho benshi mubahazi canke mubahatembera bahazi nka (Centre ville) ni ahantu hahurira abantu benshi cane mu micungararo itandukanye y'igihugu cane. Hari ibituro vyamamodoka yunguruza abantu mu zindi ntara zo mu Burundi. Isoko rikuru rya Bujumbura ryahiye igenekerezo rya 27/01/2013 ahahiriye ibintu vyinshi bituma nabantu benshi bahahombera ivyabo. Imbere yaho iryo soko risha ryari isoko rinini riteye igomwe kandi ryahurumbirwa nabantu benshi bavuye mu mihingo itandukanye y'igihugu cacu c'Uburundi. Abanyamahanga nab'Abarundi bose baraboneka mu micungararo y'iryo soko kandi ni kubera hegeranye nahantu hari ama hoteri, uburiro kandi iruhande yaho bakorera amaterefone aho bikunze kwita kuri Bata. Iryo soko ryegeranye nama komine ya Bujumbura nka Rohero, Asiatique kandi ikaba iri muri zone ya Rohero." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "umubatizo w'ukuri nawo ni mwizina RYA YESU KRISTO IVYAK 19:3\\7 IVYAK 2:38\\41" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,964.54" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,635.52" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,457.40." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,233.24." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,703.34." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 695.52" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,836.26." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "+1 000 000 : English · Deutsch · Français · Español · Italiano · Русский · Português · 日本語" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "+100 000 : Nederlands · Polski · Svenska · Українська · العربية · 中文" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Akahise k’Uburundi karanzwe n’igihe c’ubwami bwa kera bwabayeho imbere y’ubukoroni, n’imbibe zitahindutse. Uburundi bwashinze imizi kuva mu kinjana ca 16 canke ca 17 mu karere karimwo abantu kuva mu kimpumbi ca mbere imbere y’umuzo wa Yezu Kirisu. Bwari Ubwami bushingiye ku migenzo n’amategeko kama y’Imana, umwe wese akamenya ico ajejwe ariko kandi ata migenderanire ishemeye n’amakungu iriho. Ico gihugu rero kitagira imihora co muri Afirika y’Ubuseruko, gitumbereye mu karere k’ibiyaga binini kikaba kigizwe n’abahutu (bangana n’ibice 85%), abatutsi (bangana n’ibice 14%) n’abatwa (bangana n’igice 1%) kikaba kirangwa n’imico imwe n’ururimi rumwe. Indimi zizwi kandi zikoreshwa mu kazi ni ikirundi, igifaransa; igiswahili gikoreshwa canecane mu buzima b'urudandazwa." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Kimwe mu bituma indyane zidahera, ni igwirirana ry’abantu mu matongo yaze n’inkurikizi zaryo ku butunzi busanzwe bushimikiye canecane k'uburimyi. Abenegihugu bangana n'imiriyoni umunani ugereranije bagwirirana ku rugero rugwijije na kabiri uko imyaka mirongo itatu iheze, bakagwira kurugero rungana n’ibice bitatu kw'ijana (3%) ku mwaka. Tugereranije, dusanga hafi ica kabiri c’abarundi bafise munsi y’imyaka 15, ibice bingana mirongo icenda kw'ijana (90%) babeshwaho n’uburimyi." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Abangana n’ibice mirondo indwi (70%) nabo usanga baronka agahembo kari munsi y’idorari rimwe ry’Abanyamerika ku musi." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Croatia's GDP is 104 000 000 000 $ and GDP per capita 27 664 $." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Kanada yakira abimukira barenze 200,000 buri mwaka. Abageze kuri bane kw’ijana (4%), ni impunzi kandi zifashwa na Leta. Ivyo birashoboka kubera ikori itangwa n’abandi banyagihugu ba Kanada." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Indwara ya sickle-cell (anemia falciforme) ni indwara y’amaraso iterwa n’ihinduka ry’uturemangingo dutukura tw’amaraso. Ntishobora gukumirwa 100% ku muntu asanzwe ayifise mu DNA, ariko hari uburyo bwo kuyirinda kwiyongera, kuyifata kare, no kugabanya ibibazo itera:" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "b’ururimi rundi. L. L. Zamenhof yaruremye m'umwaka w'1887. Rwitiranwe Doktoro Esperanto (Umuganga Mw’icizigiro, izina y’umwandika mw’igitabo yambere y’ikisiperanto). Ururimi ruravugwa kuruta indimi zose ndemano." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Inama nkarishabwenge igira gatatu y'abigisha ikirundi mu mashure yisumbuye yabereye i Bujumbura kuva ku wa 29 Myandagaro gushika ku wa 2 Nyakanga 1983, yari yatumiye n’abigisha ikirundi muri Kaminuza y’Uburundi hamwe n’abashingwakirundi bo mu biro vy’Indero Kavukire (B.E.R.)." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Inyuma yo guheza igice ca mbere c’amashure ya kaminuza mugisata ca Electronical engineering kuri UKIM Skopje NM yaronse Ph.D kuri Ecole Pocytechnique Fédérale de Lausanne ( E.P.E.L ) mu mwaka wa 2014 . Mubucuti yagiranye na Nokia research Centre muri Helsinki, ubumenyi bwiwe bwari mu vyigwa vy’itumatumanako n’ishirwamungiro muri wireless communications." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Spotify ni amajwi yo muri Suwede yerekana amakuru hamwe na serivise zitanga amakuru yashinzwe ku ya 23 Mata 2006 na Daniel Ek na Martin Lorentzon. Ni imwe mu zitanga serivise nini zitanga imiziki ifite miliyoni zirenga 406 zikoresha buri kwezi, harimo miliyoni 180 zishyura abafatabuguzi, guhera mu Kuboza 2021. [6] Spotify yashyizwe ku rutonde (binyuze mu mujyi wa Luxembourg ufite icyicaro gikuru, Spotify Technology S.A.) ku Isoko ry'imigabane rya New York mu buryo bwo kwishyuza abanyamerika." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Inzira enye zingenzi gakondo (mārga) yoga ni jnana yoga, bhakti yoga, karma yoga na raja yoga. Basobanuwe mumyandiko nka Bhagavad-Gita. Ni hagati y'ikinyejana cya 2 mbere ya Yesu. J.-C. hamwe n'ikinyejana cya 5 cyanditswe na filozofiya yoga muri Yoga-sûtra, inyandiko yerekana yitiriwe Patañjali, hamwe na synthesis y'ibyigisho byose bihari5." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Ijambo yoga riboneka muri Rig-Veda, ibihimbano byatangiye hagati y'ikinyejana cya 15 mbere ya Yesu. J.-C. n'ikinyejana cya cumi mbere ya Yesu. Ariko, ntabwo ikoreshwa muburyo bwa disipulini yo mu mwuka, ahubwo ikoreshwa mubindi bisobanuro, nk'imodoka, n'ibindi, nubwo bamwe, nka Tara Michaël, basobanura aya magambo muri ubu buryo8. Gusa biva kuri Upanishad zimwe na zimwe zatinze, nka Shvetashvatara-upanishad niho havugwa9. Ni hagati y'ikinyejana cya 2 mbere ya Yesu. J.-C." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Akrām, A. I. (2004). The sword of Allah: Khalid bin al-Waleed, his life and campaigns. Maktabah." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Donner, F. M. (2014). The early Islamic conquests. Princeton University Press." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Interahamwe ni imbaraga z'abaturage b'abahutu b'abextremist b'igihugu c'u Rwanda. Mw'itsembabwoko ry'1994, Interahamwe zishe abatutsi (n'abahutu bateranije abatutsi) miliyoni. Interahamwe zise abatutsi inyenzi n'inzoka, na zise abahutu batari abatutsi ibyitso. Kuberako, zihisha muri Kongo. Zishaka gutsembesha abatutsi ibyuma n'imipanga." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Gitega, ni intara iri hagati mu gihugu c’Uburundi , kandi kuva mu 2019 yagenwe n’amategeko kuba umurwa mukuru wa politique w’igihugu. N’ubwo Bujumbura igisigura kuba umurwa mukuru w’ubutunzi, Gitega ifise uruhara rukomeye mu buzima bwa politike, umuco n’iterambere ry’igihugu ." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Mu mwaka wa 2018, Inama nshingamateka y’Uburundi yarize, yemera umugambi wo gusubiza umurwa mukuru wa politique i Gitega, ivyo bikaba vyarashingiwe kuri kahise k’igihugu aho Gitega yabaye umurwa mukuru w'igihugu kuva kera. Perezida Pierre Nkurunziza yarabishize mu ngiro mu ntango za 2019." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Mu mpera z’umwka wa 2010, harabonetse ibikorwa vy’iterambere muri Gitega harimwo:" },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Abanyagihugu: Imiriyaridi n'amajana ane na mirongo itandatu n'atanu y'imiriyoni n'ibihumbi amajana atanu y'imirongo ine n'icenda n'amajana atandatu y'imirongo ibiri n'itandatu (1.465.549.626 hab.) mumwaka wa 2025." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Ubudagi kikaba arico gihugu cambere ca koronije uburundi guhera mu mwaka w'igihumbi kimwe n'amajana umunani na mirongo umunani na kane ushira umwaka w'igihumbi kimwe n'amajana umunani na mirongo umunani na gatanu (1884-1885), aho ubudagi bwari buronse Uburundi, Urwanda hamwe na Tanganyika ( Ubu yitwa Tansaniya)." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Abanyagihugu: imiliyoni mirongo umunani na zitatu n'ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ine n'icenda n'amajana atatu (83.497.147hab) mumwaka w'ibihumbi bibiri na mirongo ibiri n'itanu (2025)" },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Abanyagihugu: imiliyoni zitanu n'ibihumbi amajana indwi na mirongo ine n'umunani n'amajana indwi na mirongo itandatu n'icenda (5.748.769hab) mumwaka w'ibihumbi bibiri na cumi n'indwi (2017)." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 27.834 (incuro indwi izinga rya Mayoroka);" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Uburingamire: Ibirometero kwadarato imiriyoni zitatu n'ibihumbi vy'amajana abiri na mirongo umunane n'indwi n'amajana abiri n'imirongo itandatu ya bitatu (3.287.263 km2)." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Uburinganire: ibirometero kwadarato ibihumbi amajana atatu na mirongo itanu n'indwi n'amajana atatu na mirongo umunani na bitandatu (357.588km²)" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato ibihumbi mirongo ine na bibiri n'amajana icenda na cumi na bitandatu (42.916)" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Intara ya Cankuzo iri muntara cumi n'indwi z'Uburundi, ikaba ifise km 1,965 kandi ituwemwo nabantu 172,477." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,089" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1.644" },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Intara ya Gitega iri muntara cumi n'umunani z'Uburundi, ikaba ifise kirometero kwadaro 1,979 kandi ibamwo abantu 725,223 (2008). Ifise ama Komine 11 zigabuyemwo zone 32 n' imitumba (Corine) 265. Ubu Gitega ni umugwa mukuru w'igihugu mubijanye n'intwaro" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Mu Burundi abana batangura amashure yisumbuye bafise imyaka icumi n'ibiri canke icumi n'itatu iyo batahitiye. Mu bisanzwe amashure yisumbuye agizwe n'ibice bibiri. Mu gice ca mbere abana bamara imyaka ine ku ntebe y'ishure.Ivyirwa bikuru bikuru bakurikira ni ibi: 1. Indimi(ikirundi, igifaransa n'icongereza ubu harimwo n'igiswahili): 2. Ibiharuro 3. Akahise 4. Indonda bihugu 5. Uburimyi 6. Kunonora imitsi 7. Ubuhinga" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Google Inc. ni ishirahamwe ry'imitahe ryo muri Leta Zunz'Ubumwe Z'Amerika, rifasha abanwanyi kurondera irya n'ino kuri Internet no kumenyekanisha. Kw'itariki za 30 Nyakanga, 2006; iryo shirahamwe ryakoresha abakozi (bakora ingunga zose) 9378. Rifise icicaro i Mountain View, California." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Google yatangujwe na Larry Page hamwe na Sergey Brin, tariki 7 Nyakanga, 1998. Rirongowe na Eric Schmidt, kuva aho Larry Page" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Bururi izwi nk'intara yavuyemwo abakuru b'igihugu c'uburundi babasirikare benshi cane inyuma y'ukwikukira kw'uburundi mu 1962. Batwaye bakurikirana guhera mu mwaka w'i 1966 gushika mu 1993 vyisubiriza kandi kuva mu 1996 gushika mu 2003." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Imvukira z’iyo ntara zariyungunganije zirashiraho Kaminuza y’I Mwaro mu mwaka wa 2001. Iyo Kaminuza ifise icicaro cayo mu Kibumbu, misiyoni iri mu za mbere za kera mu Burundi." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Kanada (izina riri mu rurimi rw'i Cyongereza no mu Gifaransa : Canada ) ni igihugu kinini giherereye mu gice co mu buraruko y’umugabane wa Amerika ya Ruguru Gikikijwe n’ibahari ya Atalantike mu buseruko, ibahari ya Pasifike mu burengero n’ibahari ya Arikitike mu buraruko. Nico gihugu ca kabiri kinini ku isi mu buringanire nyuma y’u Burusiya, aho gifise uburinganire bwa kilometero kare 9,984,670. Kanada ihana imbibe na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z’Amerika mu maja epfo no mu majaruguru y’uburengerazuba, ukaba ariwo mupaka muremure ku isi." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Mu myaka yakurikiye, igikoloni uko zari zitandukanye zaciye ziharira ingene zoba igihugu kimwe. Mu 1901, amakoloni yose yaciye yiyunga agira igihugu kimwe bise Commonwealth of Australia. Muri ico gihe, abantu ba Australiya bangana imiliyoni 4. Iki gitigiri ntiharimwo Benagataka baho." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "Inyenyeri y’ikimenyetso ca Commonwealth iri munsi ya Union Jack. Iyi nyenyeri ifise amasonga 7. Isonga rimwe ryerekana za ntara 6, iyindi ikamenyesha vya bice vy’intara zigenga." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "bashika ku bice 15 kw'ijana! Benshi muribo bavuga ururimi rw'igiswahili (Swahili) kandi bakaba benshi baba mu dusagara dusanga mu gihugu cose c'Uburundi." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato ibihumbi amajana indwi na mirongo umunani na gatatu n'amajana atatu na mirongo itanu na bitandatu (783.356km²)" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Ukurundana: Abantu ijana na babiri (102 personnes ) ku kirometero kwadarato ( 1km²)." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato ibihumbi amajana atanu na bitanu n'amajana icenda na cumi na kimwe (505.911km²)" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato ibihumbi mirongo itanu na bitandatu n'amajana atanu na mirongo icenda na bine (56,594km²)." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato ibihumbi amajana indwi na mirongo itanu na bitandatu n'ijana na bibiri (756 102 km²)" },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Indwara y’Igitigu ni indwara iterwa n’umugera kandi igasinzikaza igitigu. Ishobora gutuma ugutakaza akayabagu, ukuruha cane, ugucibwamwo, ukuyorwa, ububabare mu nyama no mu nda, n’indwara y’umuhondo, itera amaso n’urukoba bigasa n’umuhondo. Iyo itavuwe, ishobora gutuma igitigu cononekara, kanseri y’igitigu, canke urupfu. Hafi y’ibice 30 kw’ijana vy’abafise indwara y’igitigu nta bimenyetso vyayo bafise. Iyo ndwara igwiriye canecane mu bakuze gusumba abana." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato amajana indwi na mirongo irindwi na bitandatu (776km²)" },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Wickiana ni icegeranyo c’amasanamu ya Johann Jacob Wick (1522-1588), yashizwe hamwe mu bitabu 24 hagati y’umwaka w'1560 n’umwaka w'1587. N’isoko rikomeye ry’igihe igiporoti catangura mugihugu c’ubusuwisi." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Wolfgang Harms, Michael Schilling (eds.), Die Wickiana. Die Sammlung der Zentralbibliothek Zürich, Tübingen 1997–2005." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Ronald Wilson Reagan (1911-2004), 40. Yari umukuru w'igihugu ca Leta z’Unze Ubumwe za Amerika (1981-1989)." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Ninoslav Marina yari umuyobozi wa R & D muri Sowoon Technologies kuva 2005 – 2007. Kuva muri 2007 – 2008 yariko aragendera umunyeshure kuri Kaminuza yo muri Hawai i Manoa. Ivyo biheze kuva 2008 - 2009 yakoze nk’umudogoteri w’umushakashatsi muri Kaminuza ya Oslo. Mugihe co kuva muri 2010 – 2012. Ninoslov Marina yariko agendera position y’abadogoteri y’ubushakashatsi ikorana na Kaminuza Princeton. Nanubu aracagendera Princeton mumvo y’ubushakashatsi." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Petero Buyoya (* 24.11.1949 - 17.12.2020), umukuru w'igihugu c'Uburundi (1987—1993 na 1996—2003). Muri Nzeri 1987, Buyoya yayoboye ihirikwa ry’ubutegetsi kuri Repubulika ya kabiri y’Uburundi, iyobowe na Jean-Baptiste Bagaza, maze yishyiraho nka perezida wa mbere wa Repubulika ya gatatu. Atangaza ko ubwisanzure gahunda na yasezeranye Ubutegetsi byari guteza umubano hagati Abahutu na abatutsi moko, ariko iyobowe ahanini Abatutsi gusa. Ibintu byateje imyigaragambyo y'Abahutu muri Kanama 1988 ihitana abantu bagera ku 20.000." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Michel Micombero (* 26.08.1940, Rutovu, Uburundi — † 16.07.1983, Mogadiscio, Somariya), umukuru w'igihugu c'Uburundi (1966—1976) yakuyeho intwaro ya cami inyuma yo kwica umwami wa nyuma w'Uburundi Ntare V NDIZEYE Karori maze ashinga repuburika ya mbere. Yari umunyagitugu w'amaraso watanze ihirikwa ry'ubutegetsi rya repubulika maze agaragara nk'umuntu wiganje, nyuma yo kugerageza kwica mu 1972 yashyize ahagaragara icyiswe Ikiza cyangwa itsembabwoko ry’Abarundi aho abantu bagera ku 300.000 bishwe, Micombero yirukanwe na Jean-Baptiste Bagaza ajya mu buhungiro muri Somaliya. muri 1977 aho yari gupfira mu 1983." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Domitien Ndayizeye (* 2.05.1953, Murango, Uburundi), Yarabaye umukuru w'igihugu c'Uburundi (2003—2005)." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Petero Nkurunziza (18 Kigarama 1964 – 8 Ruheshi 2020) Bujumbura, Burundi, ni umurundi w'umunyepolitike yarôngōye igihugu c'Uburundi mukiringo c'imyaka cumi n'itanu kuva muri Myandagaro 2005 gushika muri Ruheshi 2020." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Buri Geredani yemewe agomba kwishyura amafaranga yagenwe ya US $ 4,000 wongeyeho amafaranga ahinduka. Igiteranyo cya Gerefiye ya Gerefiye igamije ko muri miliyoni 3.8 z'amadolari. Amarushanwa yakozwe na sisitemu yo kwiyandikisha isangiwe ituma abakoresha barangiza guhitamo abanditsi benshi batanga serivisi zitandukanye zijyanye nibiciro bitandukanye." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Iyo umwanditsi mukuru yiyandikishije izina rya com kumurongo wumukoresha wa nyuma, agomba kwishyura amafaranga ntarengwa yumwaka US $ 7.34 kuri VeriSign, ushinzwe kwiyandikisha kuri com, hamwe n’amafaranga US $ 0.18 y’ubuyobozi muri ICANN. Abanditsi benshi ba domaine bagura serivisi zabo nibicuruzwa kugirango bakemure amafaranga yumwaka n'amafaranga y'ubuyobozi agomba kwishyurwa ICANN. Inzitizi zo kwinjira mubikorwa byinshi byabanditsi ni byinshi kubigo bishya bidafite abakiriya bahari." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Amashure matoya atunganijwe mu myaka itandatu. Umwaka wa gatandatu uherezwa n'ikibazo ca Reta giha abarushije abandi uburenganzira bwo kwiga mu mashure yisumbuye akukira Reta. Abamenye mugabo bataronse ubwo burenganzira, baca biga amashure yisumbuye akukira amakomine. Abo kinaniye barashobora guhitira canke bagaheba kwiga, bakaja kurondera ubuzima mu myuga mitomito. Abenshi muri abo birabagora cane kwiteza imbere kuko baba bavuye mw'ishure bakiri bato kandi ata bumenyi bukwiye bafise." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Iyo nama yarihweje ingorane nkurunkuru zerekeye inyandiko y’ikirundi, yongera iratorera umuti izitari nke. Ngizi ingingo zapfunditswe n’iyo nama nkarishabwenge:" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Ra. Ne.: Ntā nsígarirazína-ngéreká muvugwá ibáhó." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Igisagara ca Gitega ni co kibanza nyamukuru ca administration ya politique mu gihugu. Ni ho usanga ibiro bikuru vya Reta, harimwo Ibiro vya Perezida, Inama nshingamateka, n’ibindi bigo vya Leta. Kuva vyemewe ko Gitega iba umurwa mukuru wa politique, harafashwe ingingo zitandukanye kugira iterambere rijane n’ico kibanza kiranga igihugu, ibikorwa, bimwe bimwe vyahora bikorerwa kumurwa mukuru w'ubutunzi Bujumbura birimurwa biduganwa Igitega." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Gitega ni imwe mu ntara zifise kahise gakomeye mu Burundi. Ni ho hasanzwe Ingoro y’imico n'akaranga (Musée National de Gitega), ikibanza gifise intonde z’ivyegeranyo vy’akahise, Imico, n’ibikoresho vyakoreshwa kera. Hariho kandi umurwi w’Ingoma z’Uburundi, waserukira igihugu kw’isi yose." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Kuva kera na rindi Abarundi bamye basenga Imana. Imbere ko abarundi bo hambere batangura kwigishwa ivy'amadini mashasha, barasenga icariho c'uwo biyumvira ko yoba asumba vyose akaba ari nawe yatumye abantu babaho. Baranashimira uwo bibaza ko asumba vyose kandi atanga vyose mu guterera. Mu guterera rero baragana inzoga,bagateka indya nziza bakongera bagatumira incuti n'abagenzi. Barashikanira uwo bibaza ko asumba vyose mu kumushikiriza imfungugwa nziza ahantu mw'ishamba bibaza ko uwo asumba vyose azohava aza kuvyakira. Ivyo babigira muntumero yo gushimira uwo bibaza ko asumba bose. Aho baba baronse umwimbu ukwiye canke nkiyo baronse umwana. Ivyo vyose babigira mu gikorwa bita KUBANDWA." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "nabo nyene ntibatanzwe kuza kwigisha ivy'Imana.Naho abarundi bari binjiye idini rishasha ry'ubukirisu, ubw'isilamu nabwo nyene bwararonse abanywanyi. Inyigisho nazo zabo zikaba zivuga ko :\"Ata Mana Ikwiye Gusengwa vy'ukuri atari ALLAH kandi ko MUHAMADI ari Intumwa y'Imana\".Ubwo butumwa bushasha bwaciye busubirira ubwo abera (missionnaires blancs) bari bigishije ko Yesu (Jésus) ari umwana w'Imana kandi ko UKWEMERA KWABO kugizwe n'UBUTATU BUTAGATIFU :Data,(Père) Mwana,(Fils) hamwe na Mutima Mweranda( Saint Esprit).Ubwisiramu rero buza buhakana ko Yesu atari umwana w'Imana ahubwo ari intumwa y'Imana nkuko nyanditswe mu gitabo ceranda Korani cahishuriwe intumwa ya Allah, Muhamadi. Ubwisilamu rero mu Burundi bushinga imizi bukebuke gushika n'ubu. Abemera idini rya Islamu babandanya bagwira gushika n'ubu aho" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Bibiliya ni igitabu ceranda kivuga inkuru, kigizwe n'ibitabu vyinshi kandi vya kera cane. Kivuga amakuru ajanye n'ukwemera kuva mu binjana vya kera cane. Ico gitabu ceranda kikaba kidufasha kuzirikana kuvy'ijambo ry'Imana." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Ikiyaga Tanganyika · Uruzi Ruvubu · Ikiyaga Rwihinda" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Wikipediya igenzurwa na Fondasiyo ya Wikimedia, umuryango udaharanira inyungu, uwucunga n'ayandi ma poroje ya Wikimedia:" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Wikimedia Commons — amafoto, amajwi n'ama reresi (video)" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Hariho izindi Wikipediya nyinshi mu zindi ndimi. Zimwe muri zo:" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Indimi z'Afrika : Kinyarwanda · Kiswahili · Lingála · Luganda · isiZulu · Hausa" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Repuburika y’Uburundi (Uburundi) ni igihugu kiri muri Afirika y’ubuseruko. Bukikujwe n'Urwanda mu buraruko; Tanzaniya mu buseruko hamwe na Repuburika iharanira intwaro rusangi ya Kongo ( RDC ) mu burengero. Ikiyaga Tanganyika kiri mu burengero bw’Uburundi kiri hafi y’umurwa mukuru w'ubutunzi ariwo Bujumbura kikaba ari ica kabiri kw’isi gifise munsi harehare kure cane." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Izina ry’Igihugu: Repuburika y’Uburundi;" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Umurwa mukuru w'intwaro (Politike): Gitega;" },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Nta muti uraboneka w'iyo ngwara; mu kugira inguvu zo gufasha abantu bamaze kugrwara iyo ngwara harimwo kubaha amazi y'ubuzima (amazi arimwo agasukari n'akunyu) canke serumu. Iyo ngwara iri hejuru ku vyerekeye urugero rwo kwica: kenshi ishobora kwica hagati y'ibice 50% na 90% vy'abafashwe. EVD yatanyuye kumenyekana muri Sudani no muri Republika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Iyo ngwara ahanini ikunda kwaduka nk'ikiza mu burere bwegereye tropike bwa Africa yo munsi ya Sahara. Kuva mu 1976 (Igihe iyo ngwara yamenyekana) gushika mu 2013, abantu bari munsi y'1,000 ku mwaka nibo bamaze gufatwa. Ikiza gikomeye gushika ubu ni Ikiza ca Ebola co mu 2014 muri Afrika y'Uburengerazuba, kimaze gufata Guinee, Sierra Leone, Liberiya nkeka no muri Nigeriya. Gushika muri Myandagaro abarwayi bashika nibo bamaze kumenyekana. Inguvu ziriko ziragirwa kugira haboneke urucanco; ariko nta na rumwe ruraboneka." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Hagereranwa ko kw'isi hariho ubwoko bw'ibiti buharurwa hagati y'ibihumbi mirongo itandatu n'ibihumbi ijana (60 000 na 100 000). Hafi y'ibice mirongo ine kw'ijana (40%) y'ubwo bwoko bw'ibiti bwoba bugeramiwe, bugenda buzimangana bukaba butakiboneka kw'isi." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Bitandukanye no kugurisha kumubiri cyangwa gukuramo, byishyura abahanzi igiciro cyagenwe kuri buri ndirimbo cyangwa alubumu yagurishijwe, Spotify yishyura amafaranga yimishahara ukurikije umubare winzira zabahanzi nkigipimo cyindirimbo zose zasohotse. Ikwirakwiza hafi 70% yinjiza yose hamwe kubafite uburenganzira (akenshi bandika ibirango), hanyuma bakishyura abahanzi bashingiye kumasezerano yabo." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "1982: HEINEKEN yaciye igura imitahe ya banke Bruxelles Lambert nayo ica iba umunyamutahe mukuru ifise ibice 60% ica yihariza umutahe hamwe na Leta Y'uburundi" },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Akamoto kabi ko mukanwa sibijanye gusa nuko utiborosheje ahubwo ni 80% kuvyerekeye imirire(digestion yivyo twariye) hamwe nindya duhitamwo kurya." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Hafi ya 80% y’amazi y’imyanda kw’isi yose asubira mu bidukikije atatunganijwe neza[4]" },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Nk’uko amakuru atangwa n’imiryango mpuzamakungu nka UNESCO abivuga, inganda zikoresha hafi 20% y’amazi akoreshwa kw’isi, kandi iyi namba iriko iriyongera uko inganda zigenda ziterambere." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Ikiyaga ca Victoria kiri hagati ya Afurika y'Ubuseruko. Tanzania ni yo ifise igice kinini caco (hafi 49%), Uganda ikagira hafi 45%, mu gihe Kenya ifise hafi 6%." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Ukurundana: Abantu amajana ane n'imirongo ine n'itandatu (446 hab/km2)" },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Ukurundana: Abantu mirongo icenda na batatu (93 personnes/km² ) ku kirometero kwadarato" },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Ukurundana: Abantu ibihumbi bitatu n'amajana atatu na mirongo irindwi na babiri ku kirometero kwadarato (3372 hab/km²)." },
        { "cell": "rate", "text": "Ubutaka bukikuje Kinindo bufise amatongo menshi y'uburimyi n'ibimera vy'ibimera . Ariko uwo musozi urafise abantu benshi cane, ufise 613 hab/km ." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Kw'isi yose aho bahimbaza umusi wa Noheli, cane cane abemera Yezu Kristru (Yesu Kristo), uwo musi washinzwe guhimbazwa kw'igenekerezo rya 25 Kigarama kira uko umwaka utashe, kuva mu kinjana ca IV." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Inyuma y'aho Ubwami burangiriye, yamaze imyaka yiwe ya nyuma yiherereye i Roma, arindwa na Papa Piyo wa VII, gushika apfuye muri Ruhuhuma 1836." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Buonaparte yabanje gufasha Pasquale Paoli mu kurwanya ingabo za Corse zishigikiye Repubulika ya Genova. Igihe Corse yabaye igice c'Ubufaransa, mu 1777, Buonaparte yabaye umuserukira ku kirimba ca Louis XVI. Nyuma y’imyaka 20 apfuye, umuhungu wiwe Napoléon yabaye Umwami w'abami w'Ubufaransa, kandi abandi bana ba Buonaparte bararonse amazina y’icubahiro kubera we." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Kugira babandanye igice ca kabiri, bategerezwa kumenya ikibazo co mu mwaka w'icumi. Abafise ubumenyi bujanye n'ibiharuro, barashobora guhitamwo kubandanya amashure yisumbuye mu gisata c'ibiharuro n'ibindi vyirwa bijanye. Abafise amanota meza mu ndimi n'ibindi vyirwa bijanye na bo bashobora kubandanya amashure yisumbuye mu gisata c'indimi. Muri ico gihe, ivyirwa abana biga biba bishimikiye ku ndimi canke ku biharuro. Bitayeko, abana barashobora guhitamwo kwiga amashure y'imyuga. Abana bahisemwo kunonosora ibiharuro canke indimi, bategerezwa gukora ikibazo co mu mwaka w'icumi na gatatu. Ni ikibazo ca Reta gihambaye cane gitanga uburenganzira bwo kwinjira muri kaminuza. (Ariko ivyo vyose kugeza unomusi vyinshi vyarahindutse kubera haje ISHURE SHINGIRO)." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Ikinyarwanda ni ururimi rw'abanyarwanda, ruvugwa kugataka k'Urwanda mumpande zose zigize iguhugu c'Urwanda. Ikinyarwanda gisa n'Ikirundi, ururimi rw'i Burundi, rukanasa n'Igiha cyo muri Tanzaniya. Nkico umuhungu umwe yitwa AMANI Nasson twasanzIkinyarwanda ni ururimi rw'abanyarwanda, ruvugwa kugataka k'Urwanda mumpande zose zigize iguhugu c'Urwanda. Ikinyarwanda gisa n'Ikirundi, ururimi rw'i Burundi, rukanasa n'Igiha cyo muri Tanzaniya. Nkico umuhungu umwe yitwa AMANI Nasson twasanze avuga." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Bibiliya yera MURAKOZE KWIZERA NO KWAKIRA no kuvuga kw' IJAMBO RY'UKURI KUBINDI BISOBANURO NITWA ADELARD" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Turavye ibitabu vy'ikirundi biri mu mashure yisumbuye, dusanga ibikurubikuru ari ivya Patiri NTAHOKAJA. Mu mashure menshi bakoresha utwatuzo turi muri ivyo bitabu. Na two ni utu:" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Gitega ni intara iri hagati mu gihugu, ifise ibisagara cumi na bitatu (13) bikwiye, harimwo n’igisagara ca Gitega, cari umurwa mukuru wa kera w'Abami b’Uburundi, ariko n'ubu carasibiye kuba umurwamukuru WA politique. Isi ndimwa iyo ntara ni nziza ku biterwa, ifise imisozi myiza, ibiyaya bito, n’ibibira. Ikirere caho kiri hagati y’ubushuhe n’ugukanya, akenshi kuwumaze kuhagera, kumurango harashuha mwijoro hagakanya, bituma uburimyi n’ubworozi bishoboka neza." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Intara ya Cibitoke ikaba ihana imbibe n'intara ya Bubanza, Kayanza RDC ndetse n'igihugu ca Rwanda." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Guhahamuka (PTSD). Ivyo bishobora gushika igihe umuntu yagize ubwoba cane canke yahuye n’ingorane zimutera ubwoba cane, nko gukubitwa, guhwana n’isanganya ry’icaduka, guterwa n’abasuma canke indwano za gisirikare. Abantu bahahamutse baguma bibuka ivyabaye, bakarara bararota ibiteye ubwoba, canke bigatuma bahwana n’ibisubira kubahahamura. Bashobora kwadukana ishavu canke bakiyotsa rwose ibibi boba barakoze, ubwoba, n’ibindi. Ukwo guhahamuka (PTSD) kurashobora kubera intambamyi ubuzima bw’umuntu bwa minsi yose. Guhahamuka birababaza cane kuko bituma uwahahamutse imiryango imikumira aho kumwegera ngo bamufashe." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Inzoga hamwe n’ibiyayuramutwe bimwe bimwe biratuma umuntu yihebura, n’ukuvuga yuko bishobora gutuma umuntu yumva ko yijiriwe, agira ivyiyumviro bibi, canke acika ikiyingiyingi. Rimwe na rimwe abantu bijiriwe canke bihebuye baca banywa inzoga zikaze kugira ngo bibagire ingorane bafise canke bagabanye ububabare, ariko ntibabone ko ivyo bituma bihebura gusumba canke indwara yabo yongerekana. Ibiyayura mutwe ni ibintu umuntu yihereza bigatuma umubiri wiwe ukora ugutandukanye n'uko wohora ukora, ikigo kijejwe amagara y'abantu OMS kivuga ko buri mwaka ibiyayura mutwe vyica za miliyoni z'abantu kw'isi." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Intara ya Makamba iri muntara cumi n'indwi z'Uburundi, ikaba ifise ibirometero 1,960 kandi ituwemwo n'abantu 430,899 (2008)." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,473.86." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,959.45." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 2,338.88" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Abanyagihugu: Imiliyoni mirongo umunani na zitatu n'ibihumbi amajana atatu n'indwi n'amajana atandatu na mirongo irindwi na bane (83.307.674hab ) mumwaka w'ibihumbi bibiri na cumi n'icenda (2019)" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Abanyagihugu: imiliyoni mirongo ine na zitandatu n'ibihumbi amajana icenda na mirongo itatu na bine n'amajana atandatu na mirongo itatu na babiri (46.934.632hab) mumwaka w'ibihumbi bibiri na cumi n'icenda (2019)" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Abanyagihugu: Imiliyoni zine n'ibihumbi ijana na mirongo icenda n'amajana indwi (4,190,700) mumwaka w'ibihumbi bibiri na cumi na gatandatu (2016)" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 110,993" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Ni ngombwa gutahura ko kugira abana bakomeze batera imbere mu myaka y’ishule, hakenewe kuba bafise intambwe yisununuye mu congereza. Abanyeshule bari mu myaka yambere y’amashule mato mato (Kindergaten –2ème année) ntibasabwa kuba bari hejuru ya ESL 3." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "I Burundi abana batangura amashure yisumbuye bafise imyaka cumi n'ibiri canke cumi n'itatu kuduga iyo batahitiye (batadubuye, batasibiye). Mu bisanzwe amashure y'isumbuye agizwe n'ibice bibiri. Mu gice cambere abana bamara imyaka itatu kuntebe y'ishure. Ivyigwa bikuru bikuru bakurikira n'ibi:" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Akamangu H1N1 2009 (izwi kandi ko ari “akamangu k’ingurube”) n’umugera mushasha ushobora kurwaza abantu. Umugera w’akamangu H1NI 2009 wandukira umuntu ku muntu nk’akamangu kaza rimwe mu mwaka. Kw’italiki ya 11 Ruheshi mu mwaka w’i 2009, Ishirahamwe Mpuzamakungu Ryo kw’Isi Yose Rijejwe Amagara y’Abantu ( WHO )ryanditse ko hateye ikiza c’indwara y’akamangu H1N1 2009. Ivyo n’ukuvuga ko umugera w’akamangu H1N1 wariko urandukira umuntu ku muntu mu bihugu vyishi." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Hari imirwi myinshi y’imigera itera indwara y’akamangu. Imwe yose bayiha izina bakurikije ibihimba vyayo. Umugera wa H1N1 bawise ubwambere “akamangu k’ingurube” kubera ugizwe n’ibice bibiri vyayo biva ku migera itera ingurube zikarwara. Indwara y’akamangu H1N1 2009 s’ico kimwe kubera irafise ibice biva ku migera y’akamangu gatera inyoni zishobora gufata n’ibice vy’imigera y’akamangu gatera abantu bakarwara. Kubera ko H1N1 ifise ibice vy’imigera idatera indwara ingurube bayita H1N1 aho kuyita “akamangu k’ingurube.”" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Abahutu n'abatutsi bafise imico n'imigenzo imwe (murimake ntatandukaniro rinini riri hagati yabo). N'imbere yuko haza igikirisu, kandi bavuga indimi zigomba gusa : mu rwanda bavuga ikinyarwanda , Mu Burundi bakavuga ikirundi. Abahutu bari batunzwe ahanini no kurima, kudandaza n'utundi tuntu bakora mugihe abatutsi nabo bari aborozi cane cane b'inka . Iciyumviro c'amacakubiri cagiye gukomezwa mu Burundi n'abakoroni. Hagiye haraba intambara nyinshi zifatiye kuriryo vangura ry'amoko aho twovuga ihonyabwoko ryakorewe abahutu 1972 Mu Burundi hamwe n'ihonyabwoko ryakorewe abatutsi 1994 Mu Rwanda." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "43. N’ibihe bihugu vyari abansi ba Leta Zunze Ubumwe bwa Amerika mu ntambara ya kabiri y’isi yose?" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "44. N’izihe ntara zibiri zigira 49 na 50 m’ubumwe bwa Leta Zunze Ubumwe bwa Amerika" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "M. Senn, Die Wickiana. Johann Jakob Wicks Nachrichtensammlung aus dem 16. Jahrhundert, Zürich 1975." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "I bururi ni naho kandi dusanga isoko ry'uruzi Nile (source du Nil) aho bita mu rutovu." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Ukurundana: Abantu amajana abiri na mirongo itatu na batatu ku kirometero kwadarato (233/km²)." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato amajana atandatu na bitandatu (606km²)" },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Songa ni ikomine yo mu ntara ya Bururi mu bumanuko bw' Uburundi. Komine Songa ifise uburinganire bwa 232,1 km². Dufatiye kuri rusansuma(recensement) yabaye mu mwaka wa 2008, ikomine ya songa yari ifise abanyagihugu bagera kuri 51831." },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato amajana atanu na cumi n'indwi (km² 517)" },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato indwi (7km²)" },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato bitanu (5km²)" },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato amajana ane na cumi (410km²)" },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Uburinganite Ibirometrometero kwadarato ijana na mirongo na bitandatu n'ibice indwi (196.7km²)" },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "3.Umwana afise indwara ya autisme ntagaragaza amarangamutima nkay'abandi bana (amarangamutima yokwishima canke yokubabara, gushavura canke gutungurwa = gutangara)." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Ndemeye Bertrand, azwi kw'izina ry'umuziki wiwe nka Berry Music, ni umuririmvyi n’umwanditsi w’indirimbo nziza wo mu Burundi. Yavukiye i Bujumbura, akaba azwi cane kubera umuziki wiwe w’imvange uhuriza hamwe Afrobeat, Afropop, na R&B, bigashimwa n’abakunzi b’umuziki haba mu gihugu imbere no mu karere ka Afurika y’Ubuseruko." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Umuziki wa Berry Music ni imvange ya Afrobeat, Afropop, na R&B, bikawugira uwisonera kandi ugezweho. Amajambo y’indirimbo ziwe avuga cane ibijanye n’urukundo, ubuzima, n’uguhimbaza, bigatuma abantu benshi bawiyumvamwo." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Kubwimana, A., AIT Brahim, L., Bousta, M. & Dewitte, O. (2018). Landslides susceptibility assessment using AHP method in Kanyosha watershed (Bujumbura-Burundi). MATEC Web of Conferences." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "OKACOM & regional water management studies" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "ubuhinzi bunini (maize & sugarcane belt)" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Uruzi rwa Ndarugu ruvira mu misozi ya Aberdare, ahantu hagwa imvura nyinshi kandi hari amashyamba. Rutembera rugana mu bumanuko bushira ubuseruko, ruca mu turere twa Kiambu (Gatundu North & South), hanyuma rugasohokera mu sisitemu y’." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "ubuhinzi bwa cash crops (coffee & vegetables)" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "kwanduzwa n’ubuhinzi (fertilizers & pesticides)" },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Abanyagihugu: 20.764hab ( ibihumbi mirongo ibiri n'amajana indwi na mirongo itandatu na bane) mu mwaka wa 2012 ( ibihumbi bibiri na cumi na kabiri)" },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Abanyagihugu: 17.600hab (ibihumbi icumi n'indwi n'amajana atandatu ) mu mwaka w'ibihumbi bibiri na cumi (2010) . Muramvya nintara nziza muntara z'igihugu c' uburundi ikaba itatswe ( isharijwe) n'ibintu vyinshi cane harimwo , amavuriro (hôpitaux), amahinguriro (Industries), inzuzuzi (rivières), amabarabara (routes)" },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Abanyagihugu: Ibihumbi bitatu n'amajana abiri na mirongo itandatu na batanu (3.265hab) mumwaka w'ibihumbi na cumi na gatandatu (2013)." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Abanyagihugu: igihumbi na mirongo icenda n'indwi (1.097hab) mumwaka w'ibihumbi bibiri na cumi na gatandatu (2013)." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Urwanda ni igihugu kiri muri Afirika, muburaruko bw'Uburundi. Kera cane kubami ndetse no kugikoroni uB" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Ariko Ubu ni ibihugu bibiri bitandukanye ndetse n'iyerambere ryavyo riratandukanye." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Iki esiperanto (Esperanto) ni ururimi rw’isi; ruravugwa hose n'abantu bashaka kuvugana." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Ikirundi ni ururimi ruvugwa n'abantu barenga imiriyoni icumi. Hamwe n'igifaransa, ikirundi ni ururimi rwemewe n'amategeko kandi rukoreshwa mu gihugu c'Uburundi. Ururimi rw'ikirundi turusanga ruvugwa mumpande zose z'igihugu c'uburundi. Ikirundi gishaka gusa n’ikinyarwanda (mumvugo no munyandiko), ururimi rw’Abanyarwanda, kigashaka gusa kandi n’igiha be n'igihangaza, indimi zivugwa muri Tanzaniya cane cane kumbibe ivyo bihugu bihana. Ikirundi nirwo rurimi kama ruvugwa mu Burundi, rukavugwa mumpande zose z'igihugu c'Uburundi (mumitumba hamwe no mubisagara)." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Ikirundi ni ururimi ruri mu ndimi zo muri afrika bantu. Rwubatswe n'amajambo kama be n'amajambo yatiwe muzindi ndimi zibanyi nk'igiswahiri be no mu ndimi z'abakoroni (igifaransa n'ikidagi) rukagengwa n'amategeko y'indimburo. Inyandiko y'ikirundi ikoresha indome ndatini, ni ukuvuga indome z'ikiratini. Cokimwe n'izindi ndimi, kumenya kuvuga ikirundi, kucandika, kugitahura be n'indimburo vy'ikirundi bisaba kuvyiga." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Uturorero: inkono y'itabi, ibikoko vyo mw'ishamba, amazi yo kw'iteke" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "agakwego hejuru y'amajwi arandira: sēsa, shīma, rāmba. akarasago ku majwi ameze nk'ayaduga bwampi: ishámi, umutwé. agatemere kubitse ku majwi ahinze amanuka: umuvyêyi, ibêre, irêmbo, umubânyi. agatemere kagaramye ku majwi ahinze aduga: icěse, umutǔmba, umwǎmi, umwǎnya. utuburungu tubiri turambitse ku majwi aduga y'urunani: böse, twëse." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Utwo twatuzo n'ubu ni two bazoba barakoresha, ariko dutegetswe mu nyigisho y'indimburo y'ikirundi gusa." }
    ],

    // The representative tier. Uniform stride over the same segments; keep it alongside the hard-set.
    "sample": [
        "Ikiyaga Tanganyika · Uruzi Ruvubu · Ikiyaga Rwihinda",
        "Muri Ruhuhuma umwaka wa 2005, Abarundi barahamagariwe kwemeza irindi bwirizwa shingiro biciye mu matora. Iryo bwirizwa shingiro risubirira iryamaze amezi 36, rirasigura neza ko Uburundi ari irepuburika yigenga, ifise intwaro rusangi kandi itisunga idini na rimwe , \" yubahiriza ubudasa bw’amoko n’amadini \". Iryo bwirizwa shingiro rirubahiriza urugero amoko aserukirwa mu vya poritike, mu nzego, mu buzi bwa reta, rikongera rikubahiriza intwaro ihuriyemwo abanyeporitike n’abajejwe umutekano mu gushinga urugero ahahutu n’abatutsi baserukirwako, badasize inyuma kwubahiriza uguserukirwa kw’abakenyezi ku bice 30%.",
        "Iyo nama yarihweje ingorane nkurunkuru zerekeye inyandiko y’ikirundi, yongera iratorera umuti izitari nke. Ngizi ingingo zapfunditswe n’iyo nama nkarishabwenge:",
        "2.Insígarirazína-ngéreká n’însígarirazína rugená: ni ijāmbo rigenékereza izína rigerétswekó.",
        "Iri hinduka ryafatiwe kandi ku mpamvu z’iterambere ry’uburere hagati mu gihugu, iringanizwa rishasha ryintara zigize uburundi, n’ugutuma igihugu kitibanda gusa kuri Bujumbura nk’igice kinini c’ubutunzi.",
        "nabo nyene ntibatanzwe kuza kwigisha ivy'Imana.Naho abarundi bari binjiye idini rishasha ry'ubukirisu, ubw'isilamu nabwo nyene bwararonse abanywanyi. Inyigisho nazo zabo zikaba zivuga ko :\"Ata Mana Ikwiye Gusengwa vy'ukuri atari ALLAH kandi ko MUHAMADI ari Intumwa y'Imana\".Ubwo butumwa bushasha bwaciye busubirira ubwo abera (missionnaires blancs) bari bigishije ko Yesu (Jésus) ari umwana w'Imana kandi ko UKWEMERA KWABO kugizwe n'UBUTATU BUTAGATIFU :Data,(Père) Mwana,(Fils) hamwe na Mutima Mweranda( Saint Esprit).Ubwisiramu rero buza buhakana ko Yesu atari umwana w'Imana ahubwo ari intumwa y'Imana nkuko nyanditswe mu gitabo ceranda Korani cahishuriwe intumwa ya Allah, Muhamadi. Ubwisilamu rero mu Burundi bushinga imizi bukebuke gushika n'ubu. Abemera idini rya Islamu babandanya bagwira gushika n'ubu aho",
        "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1,089",
        "Imvukira z’iyo ntara zariyungunganije zirashiraho Kaminuza y’I Mwaro mu mwaka wa 2001. Iyo Kaminuza ifise icicaro cayo mu Kibumbu, misiyoni iri mu za mbere za kera mu Burundi.",
        "Gukonja umubiri: imbata ntizifise ivu ryo kwirinda ubushuhe nk’abantu, rero amazi azifasha kugabanya ubushuhe bw’umubiri.",
        "Cenda canke Icenda (9) ni igiharuro canke igitigiri kiri hagati y'umunani (8) na cumi (11)",
        "Ukurundana: Abantu mirongo icenda na batatu (93 personnes/km² ) ku kirometero kwadarato",
        "Infuluwanza canke giripe itegwa n’udukoko wandura duciye mumazuru, mumuhogo no mu bihaha(mumahaha). Ibimenyetso vyiyo ngwara nibi:",
        "Vyongeye intara yose ifise ibendera ryayo.",
        "Rimwe na rimwe abantu biyahura kubera ko babona umenga n’ubuhungiro bw’ingorana barimwo canke bw’ububabare, ishavu, ivyo biyotsa, kuba ruhebwa canke nyamwigendako. Abantu baraheza bakiyumva nk’abari mu munyororo canke barengewe n’ibintu iyo bibaza ko ibintu bitazopfa bibaye vyiza gusumba canke ataco bashobora gukora kugira ngo bahindure ibintu n’ibindi. Ivyo birababangamira bikababuza kubona inyishu zibereye kandi zogira akamaro. Mu bwenge bwabo ntibipfuza gupfa ariko barondera aho bohungira. Abantu biyahura ntibabona ko bashobora guhindura ibibahanze canke ngo bamenye ingene bokwikura ivyiyumviro bibatuma bihebura.",
        "ESL 1 : Umunyeshure niho agitangura kwiga Icongereza. Abanyeshure bamwebamwe barashobora kwisigura akoreshe ijambo rimwe rimwe. Abandi banyeshure bashobora kwisigura bakoresheje amajambo n’amungane asanzwe, bagashobora no gusoma no kwandika amungane asanzwe.",
        "Iyo abantu babiri bose bafise gene ya sickle-cell, barashobora guhabwa inama z’abaganga ku ngozi yo kubyara umwana arwaye.",
        "## Igitoke kandi ushobora kukinwa umutobe( just) canke inzoga (boissons alcooliques),",
        "Anastacia ni Umuririmvyi yamuka muri Leta zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Akaba aririmba nk'uwabigize umwuga. Amazina yiwe yose ni Anastacia Lyn Newkirk, yavutse itariki 17 Nyakanga, 1968 mu Gisagara ca Chicago. Akaba aririmba indirindo za pop, soul na rock.",
        "22. Mugihe habaye ihindurwa ari itegeko nshingiro ryongeweko canje rikuweko bavyita gute?",
        "yari umurongozi w'ivyo bita Civil Right Movement, mu myaka yo 1950s -a960s, aho ubwoko bw'abirabure bwari m'ubucakara no mu gacinyizo k'aburukoba rwera, bwiyamamaza buhiga umwidegemvyo bubane ubuhuru nk'ubundi bwoko,",
        "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato 1439",
        "Abanyagihugu: 17.600hab (ibihumbi icumi n'indwi n'amajana atandatu ) mu mwaka w'ibihumbi bibiri na cumi (2010) . Muramvya nintara nziza muntara z'igihugu c' uburundi ikaba itatswe ( isharijwe) n'ibintu vyinshi cane harimwo , amavuriro (hôpitaux), amahinguriro (Industries), inzuzuzi (rivières), amabarabara (routes)",
        "Gahinasazi ni umudugudu (umutumba) uri muri Komini ya Musigati mu Ntara ya Bubanza mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'Uburundi.",
        "Saratov (ikirusiya: Саратов) ni igisagara kiri m'Uburusiya.",
        "Ingwara iterwa n'umugera wa Ebola (EVD) canke Ingwara y'ukuvira imbere no gushuha ya Ebola (EHF) ni ingwara ifata abantu iterwa n'Umugera wa Ebola. Ibimenyetso bitangura inyuma y'indwi zibiri canke zitatu umuntu afashwe n'uwo mugera, igafatira k'ubushuhe, kubabara mu muhogo, kubabara mu mitsi, hamwe no kumeneka umutwe. Ahanini iseseme, kuyorwa no gucibwamwo nivyo bikurikira, bifatanije no gucika intege vy'igitigu hamwe n'amafyigo. Kuri urwo rugero, abantu bamwe baca batangura kugira ingorane yo kuvirirana amaraso.",
        "Uburinganire: Ibirometero kwadarato indwi (7km²)",
        "Krasnodar (ikirusiya: Краснодар) ni igisagara kiri mugihugu c'Uburusiya.",
        "Cyprien Ntaryamira (* 6.03.1955, Mubimbi, Uburundi — † 6.04.1994, Kigali, Urwanda), yarabaye umukuru w'igihugu c'Uburundi mumwaka w'igihumbi n'amajana na mirongo icenda na kane (1994).",
        "Akagoti ni uruzi ruri mu Ntara ya Cankuzo mu gihugu c' UBurundi. Rukaba rugenda ruca mu mitumba ya Rwantsinda, Nyamihanda, Nyabibuga na Rutimbura muri iyo Ntara nyene.",
        "Kizito Mihigo yavukiye i Kibeho, igenekerezo rya 25 Mukakaro 1981, ni umuririmvyi n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo w'umunyarwanda. Mu mwaka wa 1994, yarokotse ihonyabwoko ryakorewe abatutsi. Ise wiwe, umushingantahe Buguzi Augustin, yaragandaguwe mw'iryo honyabwoko.",
        "Ankara, kera yitwa Angora na Ancyre mu gihe ca kera cane ( Antiquité) , ni Umurwa mukuru wa Turukiya.",
        "12 Arupakeshadi amaze imyaka mirongo itatu n'itanu yavyaye Sherahi. 13 Mu nyuma z'aho avyariye Sherahi, Arupakeshadi amara imyaka amajana ane n'itatu, avyara abahungu n'abakobwa.",
        "17 Umwami w'i Sodoma aza kumusanganira atabarutse, ahejeje gutsinda Kedorerahomeri n'abandi bami bari kumwe mu kiyaya ca Shawe, ari co kiyaya c'umwami. 18 Merekisedeki na we, umwami wa Saremu akaba yari umuherezankuka w'Imana Rudasumbwa, yamusanganije umukate n'umuvinyu. 19 Ahezagira Aburamu avuga ati:",
        "4 «Ahanje, ng'iri isezerano ryanje na we: uzoba se w'isinzi ry'ibihugu. 5 Nta wuzosubira kuguhamagara izina ryawe Aburamu; izina ryawe rizoba Aburahamu, kuko ndaguhaye kuba se w'isinzi ry'ibihugu. 6 Nzokurondora bimwe bishemeye, nzokugira iyogi ry'amakungu, abami bazokwamuka kuri wewe. 7 Nzokwunga isezerano ryanje hamwe na we, hamwe n'uruvyaro rwawe mu nyuma zawe, uko imvyaro zarwo zose zizokurikirana; iryo sezerano ribe iryo imyaka yose, kandi kubera ryo, nzoba Imana yawe n'iyo uruvyaro rwawe mu nyuma zawe. 8 Nzoguha igihugu wagiye uracumbikamwo n'uruvyaro rwawe mu nyuma zawe, igihugu cose ca Kanahani uciganzire na ntaryo. Nanje nzoba Imana yabo.»",
        "27 Aburahamu agenda kare mu gitondo aho yari yamye ahagararanye n'Umukama. 28 Yerekeza amaso i Sodoma n'i Gomora no ku ntara y'ikiyaya yose, aritegereza, abona umwotsi nk'uw'itanure uriko urafumbuka uva muri iyo ntara.",
        "11 Ariko Umumarayika w'Umukama ahamagara ari mw'ijuru avuga ati: «Aburahamu, Aburahamu!» Na we yishura ati: «Ndi hano!» 12 Umumarayika na we avuga ati: «Ntubangure ukuboko kwawe ku muhungu wawe, kandi ntihagire ico umugira! Ubu ndamenye ko wubaha Imana; ntiwimanye umuhungu wawe, ikinege cawe.» 13 Aburahamu araramura amaso, abona impfizi y'intama ng'iyo, yafatiwe mu gisaka ubw'amahembe. Aburahamu aragenda, afata nya mpfizi y'intama, ayitangako inkuka mu kibanza c'umuhungu wiwe. 14 Aburahamu aca yita ico kibanza Umukama arabona, kandi gushika n'uno musi bahita Ku musozi babonerako Umukama.",
        "66 Umusuku yiganira Izahaki ivyo yari yagize vyose. 67 Izahaki yinjiza Rebeka mw'ihema risigwa na nyina wiwe Sara, aramwabira, na we aba umugore wiwe, aramukunda; gutyo Izahaki akira intuntu yari yatewe n'ukubura nyina wiwe.",
        "1 Izahaki arasaza, amaso arahuma, ku buryo atari akibona. Ahamagara Ezawu umuhungu wiwe mukuru amubwira ati: «Muhungu wanje!» Na we yishura ati: «Ndi hano.» 2 Amubwira ati: «Urabona ko nshaje kandi ntazi umusi nzopfirako. 3 Ubu rero, hitana ibikoresho vyawe vy'uguhiga, umutana wawe n'umuheto wawe, ukwire ishamba, umpigire akanyama. 4 Uraheza untegurire imfungurwa nk'uko nsanzwe ndazikunda, uzinzanire ndye, kugira ngo ndaguhezagire ntarapfa.» 5 Akaba Rebeka yariko arumviriza igihe Izahaki yabibwira umuhungu wiwe Ezawu. Ezawu yihereza ishamba guhiga ngo azane akanyama.",
        "25 Rakeri amaze kuvyara Yozefu, Yakobo abwira Rabani ati: «Ndekura ngende, ntahe iwanje mu gihugu canje. 26 Mpa abagore banje n'abana banje nakoreye, mpeze nigire. Urazi ibikorwa nagukoreye.» 27 Rabani amubwira ati: «Ndagusavye! Ese nogira iteka mu maso yawea! Narahishuriwe ko Umukama yampezagiye kubera wewe.» 28 Yongera avuga ati: «Mbwira impembo yawe nzoyiguha.» 29 Amubwira ati: «Urazi ukuntu nagukoreye, n'ukuntu ubusho bwawe bwabaye kubera jewe. 30 Ntaraza, itunga ryawe ryari rikeyi. Ariko maze gushika ryaciye rigwira riba ryinshi, n'Umukama araguhezagira. None nk'ubu nzokorera urugo rwanje ryari?» 31 Rabani avuga ati: «None nzoguha iki?» Yakobo yishura ati: «Nta co uzompa. Niwangirira ico ngira ndakubwire, nzosubira kukuragirira n'ukukurabira ibitungwa vyawe.",
        "31 Yakobo yita aho hantu Peniyeri, ati: «Kuko nabonye Imana imbonankubone kandi nkaba nkiriho.» 32 Izuba riseruka ajabutse Penuweri, acumbagira kubera itako ryiwe. 33 Ni co gituma n'ubu bene Isarayeri batarya umutsi wo kw'imerero ry'itako, kuko uwo mugabo yakoze Yakobo ku mutsi wo kw'imerero ry'itako.",
        "27 Yakobo ashika kwa se Izahaki, i Mamure muri Kiriyati Areba, ari ho Heburoni, aho Aburahamu na Izahaki bari barabaye. 28 Imisi Izahaki yamaze, ni imyaka ijana na mirongo umunani. 29 Izahaki aracikana, apfa ashaje ageze mu zabukuru. Ahamvya abiwe. Abahungu biwe Ezawu na Yakobo baramufuba.",
        "12 Benewabo bari bagiye kuragira ubusho bwa se i Sikemu. 13 Isarayeri abwira Yozefu ati: «Benewanyu ntibagiye i Sikemu kuragira? Ingo ndakurungike iyo bari.» Na we amubwira ati: «Ndi hano.» 14 Amubwira ati: «Genda urabe ko benewanyu bari mu mahoro, ko n'ibitungwa biri mu mahoro, uheze ugaruke kumbwira.» Amurungika mu kiyaya c'i Heburoni, Yozefu ashika i Sikemu.",
        "1 Ivyo biheze, umusuku yahereza inyobwa umwami wa Misiri be n'uwacumba imikate, baracumura kuri shebuja, umwami wa Misiri. 2 Farawoni ashavurira abo bakevyi biwe babiri, umukuru w'abahereza inyobwa n'umukuru w'abahereza imfungurwa. 3 Abahereza ababacunga mu nzu y'umukuru w'abarinzi, aho Yozefu na we yari abohewe. 4 Umukuru w'abarinzi, agena Yozefu ngo abakorere. Bamara imisi mw'ibohero.",
        "8 Yozefu aramenya benewabo, ariko bo ntibamumenya. 9 Yozefu yibuka indoto yigeze kurota ziberekeye. Ababwira ati: «Muri abatasi, mwaje gutata ahoroshe kumenera muri iki gihugu.» 10 Bamubwira bati: «Oya Muhanyi, abasavyi bawe bazanywe n'ugusuma ivyokurya. 11 Twese tuvyarwa n'umugabo umwe, tukubwije ukuri, abasavyi bawe si abatasi namba.» 12 Ababwira ati: «Haba namba, mwaje gutata ahoroshe kumenera muri iki gihugu.» 13 Bishura bati: «Twebwe abasavyi bawe, twavukana turi icumi na babiri, tuvyarwa n'umugabo umwe mu gihugu ca Kanahani. Umuhererezi wacu yasigaranye na data uyu musi, uwundi na we ntakiriho.» 14 Yozefu ashira ijwi hejuru ati: «Ivyo nababwiye ni vyo, muri abatasi. 15 Ng'iki ico ndabategeyeko: ntimuzova ngaha umuhererezi wanyu adashitse hano, indahiro ni Farawoni! 16 Rungika umwe muri mwebwe aje kuzana mwenewanyu. Namwe nimugume muboshwe, kugira ngo duhinyuze amajambo yanyu, turabe ko muvuga ukuri. Ahandiho, ni izina rya Farawoni, muri abatasi!» 17 Araheza abamaza gatatu mw'ibohero.",
        "21 Bene Isarayeri bagira gutyo. Yozefu abaha imikogote nk'uko Farawoni yabivuze, abaha n'impamba y'urugendo. 22 Umwumwe amuha impuzu z'uguhindura, abigira kuri bose. Benyamini amuha amafeza amajana atatu n'imyambaro itanu y'uguhindura. 23 Arungikira se wiwe indogobwe icumi zikoreye ibintu vyizavyiza vyo mu Misiri, n'indogobwe icumi zivyara zikoreye ingano, imikate, n'ibifungurwa vy'urugendo rwiwe. 24 Araheza arungika benewabo, baragenda. Ababwira ati: «Mu nzira ntimugende muratongana.»",
        "1 Ivyo biheze, babwira Yozefu bati: «So wawe ararwaye.» Yozefu ajana n'abahungu biwe babiri, Manase na Efurayimu. 2 Babimenyesha Yakobo bati: «Umuhungu wawe Yozefu araje.» Yakobo ari we Isarayeri arinanata, yicara ku buriri. 3 Yakobo ari we Isarayeri abwira Yozefu ati: «Imana Mushoboravyose yarambonekeye i Ruzi mu gihugu ca Kanahani, kandi irampezagira, 4 imbwira iti: Ngiye kukurondora, ndagusasagaze, ube ikoraniro ry'amakungu. Iki gihugu nzogiha uruvyaro rwawe mu nyuma zawe, ruciganzire na ntaryo. 5 Ubu rero, aba bahungu babiri wavyariye mu gihugu ca Misiri ntaraza iwawe mu Misiri ni abanje. Efurayimu na Manase bazoba abanje nka Rubeni na Simeho. 6 Ariko abana bawe wavyaye mu nyuma zabo bazoba rwawe, bazohamagarwa gutorana umugabane wabo kw'izina rya benewabo.",
        "umushaha wanje ntukifatanye n'akagwi kabo!",
        "ku mugoroba na ho, rikagabanganya ivyasahuwe.»",
        "Kenneth Ronald \"Ken\" Berry (* 11.3.1933, Moline, Illinois – * 1.12.2018, Burbank, California).",
        "Shah Rukh Khan (wavutse ku ya 2 Ugushyingo 1965), uzwi kandi ku ntangiriro ya SRK, ni umukinyi w’umuhinde, utunganya amalelesi, ndetse n'imboneshakure. Yavuzwe mu bitangazamakuru nka \"Baadshah ya Bollywood\" (yerekeza kw'ilekesi yiwe Baadshah yo mu 1999),",
        "Muri rusangi, inzuzi ni isoko rikomeye ry'amazi, ubutunzi n'iterambere ry'ibihugu.",
        "Noheli, canke Noweli, Noweri (mu congereza : Christmas ; mu gifaransa : Noël) ni umusi mukuru uhimbaza ivuka rya Yezu Kristru (Yesu Kristo) w'i Nazareti.",
        "Évariste Ndayishimiye yavukiye mu ntara ya Gitega,muri komine Giheta mugi 1968.Mu 1995 igihe yari yiga muri kaminuza y'Uburundi, yararokotse igihe hariko haricwa abanyeshure babahutu aca aja kwifadikanya nabarwanya ubutegetsi bw'ico gihe aribo FDD,inyuma yigandagurwa rya perezida Melchior Ndadaye.Inyuma y'imyaka ishika 10 ari muri FDD, Évariste Ndayishimiye yari commandant uratwara uturere dutandukanye gutyo gutyo aza araduga mu gisirikare.Mu 2005,inyuma y'amasezerano y'i Arusha yoguhagarika intambara, Évariste Ndayishimiye, yagenywe kurongora ibiro bikuru vya gisirikare,acahabwa n'ipete rya generari.",
        "Wiki Loves Africa 2019 yabaye kucivugo c'umukinyi",
        "2014: Brarudi yatanguye gukora inzoga yitwa Nyongera. Brasserie y'i Gitega akaba ariyo ikora ico kinyobwa cane.",
        "Aha twotanga uburorero nk'ingo zabura uruvyaro,abapfisha inka cane,abakobwa bateba kuronka abagabo,Imiryango yakunda guterwa n'intezi ndetse nizindi ndwara zivyaduka.......Muri make abanyagihigu mu gusenga bategerezwa guca kuri Kiranga kugirango abasabire ku Mana ivyo bifuza vyose.",
        "Harihó ingoma irongôra izĭndi bītá Inkĭranya, hakaba na zírya ngoma níni bītá ibishíkizo, n'íngoma ntôntó bītá amashāko. Izo ngoma rēró zibāzwa cāne cȃne mu gitī citwá Umuvúgāngoma, n´íkĭndi cītwá umusȃvé.",
        "Ikirumbarumba (Ikirumbagane): yaba ari umuhungu yabuze umugore canke yaresha bakamubenga;",
        "Se w'umuhungu yasanga bamuteguriye Intebe y'umukwe. Mu gihe bamaze kubazimana Se w'umuhungu yaratangura akavuga ijambo ryo gusaba Irembo Hama Se w'umukobwa akamwishura rero iyo bamushimye barabaherekeza bakabatekerera n'umubindi wa 3 wo kw'ivuna akanyota.Iyo bamwanse hoho no kumuherekeza ntibamuherekeza.",
        "Inanga, nk’ayandi mayagwa yose y’ikirundi zishikiriza iciyumviro kandi zigakoreshwa muguteramisha abantu. Ivyiyumviro vyakunda kuba bivurwa muri izo nanga kwari nko kwivuga uwakugabiye, (Inanga ya Bigoro), ugutera inkuru yabaye ( Inanga ya Maconco), Ubuzima mu kibano (Umuhirwe ni nde), ndetse no Kuresha ( Inanga \"Urambera umukunzi\" ya Donasiyano w’i Muramvya).",
        "Kugira uwo mukuza uvuge cane barawufatanya n’umugozi w’impuzu canke umugozi uvuye kugiti c’igitoke bakawushira hagati kw'ifundo rya gatatu kugira birinde ugukoranako kwose kutameze neza hagati y’umukuza n’ico giti gihese.",
        "Ishuri muri Bamako, Mali na Ouagadougou, Burkina Faso",
        "The Grand Al Hassanayni Mosque (risigura: The “ba Hassan babiri” umusigiti) womuri Darou Hidjiratou wubatswe n’igisata mpuzamakungu Mozdahir numurongozi Waco Cherif Mohamed Aly Aidara. Uwo musigiti wataziriwe mugateka ka Cherif Al-Hassane Aidara nigisekuru ce Al Hassane Al Mojtaba ibn Ali, umwuzukuruza wintumwa Muhamedi hamwe nuwakabiri muri cumi nababiri imamu na cumi na babiri ba Shii.",
        "Ukwezi kwa mbere ni Nzero. Nzerere kwari ukwezi abantu bazerera baja gusuma, kwari ukwezi kandi babibamwo amahonda.",
        "Buri Geredani yemewe agomba kwishyura amafaranga yagenwe ya US $ 4,000 wongeyeho amafaranga ahinduka. Igiteranyo cya Gerefiye ya Gerefiye igamije ko muri miliyoni 3.8 z'amadolari. Amarushanwa yakozwe na sisitemu yo kwiyandikisha isangiwe ituma abakoresha barangiza guhitamo abanditsi benshi batanga serivisi zitandukanye zijyanye nibiciro bitandukanye.",
        "Nkuko bisanzwe mumwaka hariho ibihe bibiri bikuru bikuru ibihe vy'imvura n'igihe c'izuba arico bita ici.Mu Burundi co kimwe no mubindi bihugu vyo mubuseruko(ibihugu biri hejuru y'umurongo ugabura isi mubice 2 bingana) ici ritangura mu kwezi kwa 6 rigahera mu kwezi kwa 9.Ariko uko imyaka igenda ihindagurika niko n'ibihe bihindagurika gutyo ugasanga n'amezi y'ici yiyongereyeko canke akagabanuka.",
        "Agatasi rero ni igihe nyamukuru mu gihugu cacu c'uburundi, aho imiryango irima ibitegwa mbumbarugo. Ico gihe gitangura mu kwezi kw'icenda",
        "Rufasha ibiti, amafi n’ibindi binyabuzima kubaho, bigatuma ibidukikije bigumana ubuzima bwiza.",
        "Uruzuba rwinshi rutuma ibifungurwa bitera neza hagaca haduka inzara, abantu bagapfa, amashamba agahona be n'ibikoko biyabamwo;",
        "Intara ya Kirundo ni intara imwe mu ntara cumi n'umunani zigize igihugu c'uburundi, ikaba iri m'uburaruko bw'igihugu c'uburundi, m'ubumanuko bw'igihugu c'urwanda. Intara ya Kirundo igizwe n'amakomine indwi: Kirundo, Vumbi, Bugabira, Gitobe, Ntega, Bwambarangwe na Busoni.",
        "Mumateka yiwe yamenyekanye nk umukinyi yinjiza ibitsindo vyinshi , amenyekana kandi nk umusatirizi rurangiranwa wo mu gihe ciwe. Chevchenko ni umukinyi agira gatanu kw isi mubakinyi bashoboye kwinjiza ibitsindo vyinshi mumarushanwa y i Burayi kubitsindo 67 akongera akaba n uw indwimubakinyi binjije ibitsindo vyinshi muri League des champions kubitsindo 59 munkino143 z i Buraya mumarushanwa yose.",
        "Kwuma mu gitsina gore n'imwe mundwara zibangamiye abakenyezi n'abigeme batari bake kw'isi yose haba mubihugu biteye imbere canke ibiri munzira y'amajambere. Igiteye ubwoba aho kwitura abobafasha bapfana isoni abandi bagapfana impfane kubagabo babo ngo nta mugore atagira amazi kiretse abatazi kuyarondera. Ivyo navyo bigaca biteza ingorane mungo, umugabo akarabwa nabi n'umugore ngo ntaco amaze, umugore nawe agaturubikwa ngo yarumye.",
        "Ikindi, nk'uko abo bakenyezi twayaze babivuze, ngo bahejeje kwibaruka, ntibasubira kwibuka ayo majambo yose kubera umunezero wo gukikira ikibondo Cabo baba baronse.",
        "Kanyosha ikaba yahoze ari imwe mu ma Komine agize Intara ya Bujumbura Mairie ariko mu nyuma vyagiye guhinduka mugihe habayeho uguhindura amakomine mu Ntaraya Bujumbura Mairie ikaba yaciye igira Ikomine zitatu zikaba ari Muha,Ntahangwa na Mukaza. Hamaze kubaho iryo hinduka rya Makomine Kanyosha ikaba yaciye ihinduka ikaba Umutumba(zone) wo muri Komine Muha.",
        "Niyo mpamvu ukwo ubumara buba bwinshi niko hashika igihe igitigu cononekara hagaca habaho indwara y'igitigu.",
        "N'ayo akazina \"Dudu\" bakamwise ari muto kubera ibintu vyose yavyita \"Dudu\" baca barakamutazira gushika na bugingo n'ubu. Yatanguye kuririmba afise imyaka icumi n'itanu (15). Yahereye kuri \"Centre Jeune Kamenge\", yari mu runganwe rumwe na ba Kaka Boney\".",
        "2.Mubisanzwe Umwana afise amezi 9 iyo umuhamagaye mw'izina urabona ko yimenya kandi akitaba canke akakwereka ko yiyumvise. Ni ukuvugako aba azi ko atandukanye n'uwundi muntu runaka nubwo atoba ashoboye kuvuga ngo atobore ngo avuge neza, ico ni ikimenyetso kikwereka ko umwana ubwonko bwiwe bukora neza. Ariko uwufise iyondwara ya autisme ntabwo yitaba canke ngo agire ikimenyetso na kimwe kikwereka ko yumvise ko wamuhamagaye.",
        "Kenya ni igihugu kimwe mubihugu biri kumugabane wa Afrika kikaba no Muri Afrika y'ubuseruko, ndetse kikaba kiri no mubihugu bigize umuryango wa Afrika y'ubuseruko.",
        "Ni Ijambo ry'ikirundi rikoreshwa mu Burundi irisigura igihimba c'umubiri w'umukobwa kiri musi y'ibitugu.",
        "Igikoresho bakoresha mu kurima (ibiharage,ibigori,ibiraya ,iibitoke)",
        "Ibikorwa vy’igihanga ni ugukingira ubwonko, gutanga umwanya ku maso no ku matwi kugira ngo umuntu abone neza kandi amenye aho amajwi ava. Ku bikoko bifise amahembe, igihanga gikingira mu gutanga ahashingira amahembe.",
        "kanyongatereza yaratuvyariye incungu tumukund kokoyarimamawabarund weyerekanye urukundokubarund mugutang umwana wiwe mugihe camakuba akamurungika muntambwe ngo aje gucungura abarundi tumenyereye umuvyeyi atarekura umwana mugihe ibintu biba vyakomeye ariko we yarabikoze nkumuvyeyi wabarundi kanatsinda yararamurungitse mubariko baradukoronizakungurayo ubumenyi akonakarorero kubandi bavyeyi ko bokundisha ishure abana babo",
        "Mu mpera z'imyaka ya 90, amaze gusohora umuziki wiwe wa mbere mu mugwi Nigga soul, Mugani Désiré yaciye afata ingingo yo gutangura umuziki wiwe wenyene. Yavumbuwe na Kidum Kibido, umuhinga mu vy’ubuhinga bw’amasanamu w’Umurundi aba muri Kenya, amuha amasezerano yo gukora iyo filime.",
        "uruzi mugere ruherereye mubumanuko bwigisagara ca Bujumbura. ariko rukaba rukomoka muri komine ya mukike musi yumusozi wa heha biherereye muntara ya Bujumbura bankunze kwita (bujumbura rural)",
        "Yasohoye indirimbo nyinshi zirimwo umudiho wa RnB.",
        "Dushimirimana Bénie ni umukenguzamateka akomoka mu gihugu c'Uburundi akava mu ntara ya Kayanza avuka mu 1980.",
        "Inyuma y'amatora yo 2018 y'ibwirizwa nshingiro haragiyeho intara nshasha hisunzwe indinganizo nshasha ifatiye kuberere no kwiterambere ryabwo icogihe inama shingamateka yaratoye yongera iremeza ko intara 5 arizo zigiye kurangwa mugihugu cose",
        "umunyafrika atari Umunya-Uganda agiye kuruwo mwanya kuva mushigwa ry’iyo misiyo mu 2007.",
        "- Amazi menshi: Umuceri umera neza mu mazi (akenshi utera mu buryo bwitwa \"paddy fields\").",
        "NKAKARORERO, waruzi ko ushobora kumara umusi wose utibrosheje ariko mukanwa ukaguma uhema akamoto keza?",
        "- Bishobora kongerwamo amabuye kugira ngo habe *beton* yo gusakara cangwa gukora fondasiyo.",
        "Mumvugo zicisha make ( imvugo mbabariramatwi): Hari amazina y’uruhindu nka \"igituba c’umugabo\" canke bakavuga \"igihimba c'irondoka c'umugabo\"",
        "Inkuru ya Livingstone na Stanley mu Burundi ni inkuru y'ubutwari yaranzwe n'ubushakashatsi irimwo uruja n'uruza rw'amateka. Ni imwe muzamenyekanye cane mu mateka y'ubushakashatsi bwa Afurika ,ikagira uruhara mu nzira z'ivugabutumwa, ubucuruzi,n'ukwigarurira ibihugu( colonisation).",
        "Igikorwa ca Khalid kirangwa n’ubuhinga budasanzwe bwo gutera vuba no gukoresha amayeri yo gutera ubwoba abansi. Inyuma y’urupfu rwa Muhammad, yaraye imbere intambara za Ridda (intambara zo kugarura abari bava mw’idini), ahuza amashyamba ya kure y’Abarabu munsi y’Ubwami bwa Isilamu. Intsinzi ziwe zikomeye kuruta izindi zabaye mu gihe co kwigarurira Ubwami bwa Peresi (Sassanid) n’Ubwami bwa Byzantine muri Siriya.",
        "Ku ruhande rw’Uburundi, Ikiyaga Tanganyika gikora ku ntara za Bujumbura Mairie, Bujumbura Rural na Rumonge, aho kibera isoko ikomeye y’ubuzima ku banyagihugu.",
        "Mu nyuma, amazi yarwo yisuka mu rundi ruzi runini bita Mucece, aho amazi yarwo akomeza urugendo rwerekeza mu yindi migezi minini y’igihugu.",
        "Gukingira amazi si itegeko ry’amahinguriro gusa, ahubwo ni iya bose: leta, abikorera, n’abanyagihugu. Muri kazoza hasukuye haterwa n’ingingo dufata uyu musi.",
        "Amazi ni kimwe mu bikoresho nyamukuru bikoreshwa mu buzima bwa buri muntu wese no mw'interambere ry’isi yose. Mu mahinguriro (industries), amazi mu Mahinguriro afise akamaro kanini cane gose kuko afasha mu bikorwa bitandukanye birimwo gukora ibidandazwa, gukonjesha amamashini, gusukura ibikoresho no gutanga inguvu nk'umuyagankuba zikoreshwa mu bikorwa bimwe bimwe. Mu gihe iterambere ry’amahinguriro rikomeza kwiyongera, n’ikoreshwa ry’amazi naryo riragenda ryiyongera cane, ivyo bigatuma hakenerwa imigambi yo kuyabungabunga no kuyakoresha neza mugihugu.",
        "Mu gihe c’ubu, hari n’imashini zo kumesura (washing machines) zifasha abantu gukora iki gikorwa mu buryo bworoshe kandi bwihuta.",
        "Uruzi rwa Mugere ni rumwe mu nzuzi zikomeye zo mu burengerazuba bw'Uburundi. Ruherereye mu ntara ya Bujumbura Rural, rugaca mu misozi yegereye Ikiyaga Tanganyika mbere yo kwisuka muri ico kiyaga. Uru ruzi rurazwi cane kubera isumo rya Mugere, rimwe mu bibanza bikurura ba mukerarugendo (ingenzi) benshi mu Burundi. Uruzi rwa Mugere rufise uruhara runini mu kubungabunga ibidukikije, mu guteza imbere uburimyi no mu gutanga amazi akoreshwa n'abanyagihugu bo mu micungararo yarwo.",
        "Uruzi ruva mu rusobe rw’iyindi migezi mito mito n’amazi n’ibishanga, rugahurira hamwe n’ayandi mazi y’akarere ka Niger Delta.",
        "Amazi ya Ruvubu afasha mu bikorwa vy'uburimyi, cane cane mu bibaya biri hafi y'uru ruzi. Abanyagihugu bakoresha ayo mazi mu kuvomera imirima no mu bindi bikorwa vy'ubuhinzi.",
        "Uruzi rwa Nil rufise imiterere igoye kuko ruturuka mu turere dufise ikirere gitandukanye. Hari ibice bifise imvura nyinshi (nk’u Rwanda, Burundi, Ethiopia), n’ibice bifise ubutayu (nk’Misiri).",
        "Izina « Ruvubu » rikomoka ku ijambo ry'Ikirundi « imvubu », kubera ko uru ruzi rwahora rubamwo imvubu nyinshi .",
        "Uruzi rwa Mucece rufise akamaro kanini mw'iterambere ry'abanyagihugu bo muri Komine Kiganda. Amazi yarwo akoreshwa mu kuvomera imirima, cane cane iy'imboga, ibigori, ibiharage, imyumbati n'ibindi vyimburwa birimwa kuri uryo ruzi.",
        "Uruzi rwa Muha (mu gifaransa: rivière Muha) ni uruzi rwo mu gihugu c'Uburundi, ruca mu bumanuko bw'igisagara ca Bujumbura. Rufise ibibazo vyinshi vy'imyuzure n'isuri, bikongerezwa no gucukurwa kw'umusenyi n'amabuye mu ruzi kugira bikoreshwe mu kwubaka.",
        "Muri ico gihe, amazi meza yari make cane mu mitumba myinshi. Ivyo vyatumye amasoko kavukire nk'iri vomo aba itunga ridasanzwe ku banyagihugu. Hari imiryango yavoma amazi menshi ku munsi kugira ishobore kurangura ibikorwa vyayo vya misi vyose.",
        "Mu gihe c’imvura, ibikoko vyinshi birahurira ku nkengera z’uruzi kugira ngo bibone amazi n’ibifungurwa. Ivyo bituma Buffels riba ahantu h’ingenzi mu guhuza ibinyabuzima.",
        "Aka karere karangwa kandi n’ubushuhe bwinshi ku murango hamwe n’ubukonje bwiyongera mw’ijoro, ikintu gisanzwe kiboneka mu turere tw’ubutayu.",
        "Uruzi rwa Rusizi ni uruzi rudasanzwe mu karere k’ibiyaga binini. Naho rutari rurerure cane, rufise akamaro kanini mu:",
        "Uruzi rwa Ruvyironza ni uruzi ruto ruri mu gihugu c’Uburundi ariko rufise agaciro kanini cane ku rwego mpuzamakungu. Ruzwi cane mu bushakashatsi bwa géographie n’amateka y’inzuzi zo muri Afrika kubera ko rufatwa nk’imwe mu masoko ya kure cane (remote source) y’uruzi runini rwa Nile, uruzi rurerure kw’isi.",
        "Uruzi rwa Murembwe ni umutungo kamere ukomeye cane mu Burundi. Rufise uruhara runini mu buzima bw’abantu, mu bukungu, no mu bidukikije. Naho rufise ibibazo nk’isuri, imyuzure, n’umwanda, rushobora gukomeza kuba isoko y’iterambere igihe rwitabweho neza.",
        "Bamwe bavuga ko riva ku mvugo y’Ikirundi n’Ikinyarwanda isobanura “umugezi muto ariko uhoraho”.",
        "Uruzi rwa Muhwazi rufatwa nk’igice c’urusobe rw’amazi (hydrographie) rwo mu Burundi, rukagira uruhara mu:",
        "Uruzi rwa Ndurumu rutangurira mu turere two mu misozi n’ahantu harimwo imvura nyinshi ku mwaka wose. Amasoko yarwo aturuka ku:",
        "Uruzi rwa Kabuyenge ni rumwe mu migezi mito ivugwa mu bice bitandukanye vy’igihugu ca Burundi. Naho ata makuru menshi yanditse ku rwego mpuzamakungu aboneka ku buryo burambuye, izina “Kabuyenge” rikunze gukoreshwa mu mvugo y’abanyagihugu mu kwerekana imigezi mito, amasoko y’amazi, canke imigende y’amazi igira uruhara runini mu buzima bwa misi yose.",
        "Uruzi rwa Magara ruherereye mu buraruko canke hagati mu gihugu c’Uburundi (bitewe n’akarere kavugwa na bamwe mu baturage), mu micungararo y’imisozi mito n’ibibaya bifise ubutaka burimwo ivyatsi n’amashyamba mato.",
        "Uruzi rwa Gikoma ni uruzi ruto ugereranije n’izindi nzuzi nini zo mu Bujumbura, ariko rufise akamaro gakomeye cane mu buhinzi, ibidukikije, n’ubuzima bw’abanyagihugu. Naho rufise ibibazo vy’imyuzure, isuri n’imyanda, rushobora gusubira kuba isoko rikomeye ry’iterambere iyo rutunganijwe neza.",
        "Naho hataboneka ikarata yemewe mpuzamakungu irugaragaza neza, Murago rufatwa nk’uruzi rwo mu rusobe rw’imigezi igaburira amazi mu nzuzi zikuru z’igihugu.",
        "ruva mu misozi miremire yo mu buseruko bwa Tanzania, aho amasoko y’amazi ava ku misozi ya Kilimanjaro na Meru ahurira agatanga uruzi runini. Uru ruzi rugenda rwerekeza mu buseruko, ruce mu bibaya, mu mirima n’amashyamba, mbere rugasozera urugendo rwarwo mu nyanja y’Indiyano hafi y’igisagara ca Pangani.",
        "Ibisobanuro rusangi ku nzuzi zigaburira Inyanja y’Indiyano",
        "kugenzura imigambi y’ingomero z’amashanyarazi",
        "Raporo z’ibidukikije zo muri Tanzania na Mozambique",
        "gifatwa nk’ikiyaga gifise urusobe rw’ibinyabuzima rudasanzwe",
        "gifatwa nk’inkingi y’iterambere mu karere ka Rift Valley. Ni ikiyaga gihuza ibihugu bitatu mu bijanye n’ubukungu n’ibidukikije.",
        "kugabanuka kw’amazi kubera ihindagurika ry’ibihe",
        "amazi menshi aratakara mu butayu (evaporation)",
        "Aha uruzi ruba rutemba buhoro mu bibaya vya Zambia. Ni ahantu hari ibishanga binini, amafi menshi n’inyamaswa nyinshi. Uruzi rufise inzira ziva mu migezi mito mito n’ibishanga.",
        "Rufatwa nk’inkingi y’ubukungu mu bihugu ruca mu: Lesotho, Afurika y’epfo, na Namibia.",
        "imvura igwa cane hagati ya Nyakanga–Ukwakira",
        "Aha Black Volta, White Volta na Red Volta bihurira muri Ghana, bigatanga uruzi runini.",
        "Mu bibaya vy’uru ruzi haraboneka kandi ibishanga bifasha mu kubika amazi no kugabanya umuvuduko w’imyuzure.",
        "Mu nkengera za Awash haboneka ibinyabuzima vyinshi. Harimwo impala, gazelle, inguge, impyisi, intare, ingona n’amoko menshi y’inyoni.",
        "Uruzi rwa Sobat ruvuka aho hahuye imigezi ikomeye irimwo Baro River, Pibor River, n’utundi tugezi twinshi tuva mu buseruko bwa Sudani y’Epfo no mu misozi ya Ethiopia.",
        "Amazi y’uruzi rwa Mbam ava ahanini mu mvura nyinshi igwa mu karere k’amashyamba ya Cameroun. Imigezi mito mito iva mu bibaya n’imisozi ihurira hamwe ikagira uruzi rukuru.",
        "Uruzi rwa Shashe ni uruzi rukomeye mu karere ka Afrika y’Ubumanuko, rufise uruhara runini mu kugaburira uruzi rwa Limpopo no mu gushigikira ubuzima bw’abantu n’ibinyabuzima. Naho ruhura n’ingorane z’imvura idahoraho n’ihindagurika ry’ibihe, rukomeje kuba isoko ry’iterambere, ubuhinzi n’ubworozi mu bihugu rurimwo.",
        "Isuri iterwa n’ugucukura amatongo ku nkengera z’uruzi",
        "imihindagurikire y’ibihe (climate change)",
        "rufite umuvuduko mwinshi mu bice byo hejuru",
        "Rufatwa nk’uruzi runini mu gutwara amazi yo mu mujyi wa Kigali n’ibice bikikije.",
        "Uhumane ry’amazi riva mu myanda yo mu bisagara",
        "Aborozi bakoresha amazi y’uruzi mu kuvomera ibitungwa nk’inka, ihene n’intama, cane cane mu bihe vy’izuba.",
        "Rufasha mu kuhira imyaka, cane cane mu bice bifise imvura idahagije. Imirima ikikije uru ruzi ikura neza kubera amazi aboneka hafi.",
        "Uruzi rufasha mu kubungabunga ubuzima bw’ibinyabuzima bito bito vyo mu mazi n’inkengera zarwo, nk’amafi mato, udukoko tw’amazi n’ibimera vyo mu migezi.",
        "Ni uruzi rufise akamaro mu buzima bw’abantu, mu buhinzi, mu bidukikije, no mu gutanga amazi mu bice vyumye vya Afrika y’Ubuseruko.",
        "Gukomeza uruja n’uruza rw’amazi mu gihe c’imvura",
        "Ethiope ifatwa n’abantu benshi nk’imwe mu nzuzi zifise amazi meza cane muri Nigeria, kandi ifise akamaro kanini mu buzima bw’abanyagihugu, uburovyi, ubukerarugendo n’ibidukikije.",
        "Akarere: imisozi mito n’amashamba y’itose",
        "Ni ahantu ho guhura no gukora ibikorwa vya misi yose",
        "Uruzi rwa Pra rufatwa nk’isoko y’ubuzima",
        "Rurihindagurika (seasonal river mu bice bimwe)",
        "Rurimwo isano n’uruzi rwa Niger na Volta mu karere ka Afrika y’Uburengero",
        "Ni rumwe mu nzuzi zikomeye cane mu burengero bwa Côte d’Ivoire",
        "Ruri mu nzuzi zikomeye za coastal Guinea",
        "Hahingwa ibihingwa vyo mu ngo n’ibindi vy’ubucuruzi",
        "Lake Chad ni ikiyaga kinini giherereye muri Afrika yo hagati n’iy’Uburaruko (Sahel region). Gisangwa ku mipaka y’ibihugu bine: Chad, Cameroon, Nigeria, na Niger. Ni kimwe mu biyaga bikomeye cane mu mateka ya Afrika kubera uruhara gifise mu mazi, ubuhinzi, uburovyi n’ubuzima bw’abantu.",
        "Gukoresha amazi ku rugero runini mu kuhira imirima",
        "Akarere ruhetse: gahuza ibice binini vy’amashamba, ibishanga n’imisozi ya Ethiopia na South Sudan",
        "Amazi yarwo agenda ahinduka cane (rimwe rwinshi, rimwe rukeya)",
        "Rwari n’isoko y’ubuzima ku bwami bwa kera nka Ajuran Empire",
        "Uruzi rwa Tekeze ni rumwe mu nzuzi zikomeye za Etiyopiya n’akarere ka Nile. Rufise akamaro kanini mu ngufu z’amashanyarazi, ubuhinzi n’amazi, kandi rufise n’akamaro kanini mu mateka n’umuco w’akarere karwo.",
        "Rurangwa n’uko amazi yaryo ahinduka hisunzwe ibihe vy’imvura",
        "Rutangurira mu burengero bw’Ikiyaga ca Tanganyika",
        "ibice bifise amazi menshi mu gihe c’imvura,",
        "Rutangura mu migezi mito mito yo mu misozi",
        "Uruzi rwa ni rumwe mu nzuzi zikomeye zo mu gihugu ca , ruherereye mu gice co hagati n’ico mu bumanuko bwa Congo Basin. Ni uruzi rurekure, ruca mu mashamba manini ya tropique, kandi rufise uruhara runini mu bidukikije no mu mibereho y’abantu baba ku nkengera zarwo.",
        "Impinduka z’ibihe (climate change) zishobora guhindura urwego rw’amazi",
        "Ruca mu bice vyose: imisozi, ibibaya n’ishamba",
        "rugira uruhara mu guhuza imisozi, ibibaya n’ishamba rinini",
        "Ariko rapids zituma ubwikorezi bugorana mu bice bimwe",
        "Ni uruzi runini cane rufise amazi menshi (high discharge)",
        "Mu ntara ya Ngounié Province (yahawe izina n’uruzi nyene)",
        "Rurasuka mu nyanja ya Atlantique hafi ya Pointe-Noire",
        "Ni uruzi rufise amazi menshi cane (high discharge)",
        "Ruri munsi y’ingaruka z’inyanja (tides) mu bilometero byinshi imbere",
        "rutuma amashyamba agira ubuzima (ecosystème)",
        "Amoko menshi y’inyamaswa: inguge (chimpanzees), gorillas, n’andi moko y’inyamaswa z’ishyamba",
        "Uruzi rwa Sokoto ruvira mu misozi n’ibibaya byo mu buraruko bushira uburengero bwa Nigeria, cane cane mu ntara za Zamfara n’inkengero zayo. Amazi yarwo atangura ava mu migezi mito mito (tributaries), hanyuma agahurira hamwe akavamo uruzi runini.",
        "Uruzi rwa Hadejia ruvira mu misozi n’ibibaya biri mu ntara za Kano na Jigawa. Amazi y’imvura n’imigezi mito mito ni yo atuma rutangira.",
        "Uruzi rwa Rima ruvira mu bibaya n’imisozi mito ya Katsina na Zamfara mu buraruko bwa Nigeria. Amazi yarwo atangura ava mu migezi mito mito n’imvura igwa mu gihe c’imvura.",
        "ni rumwe mu migezi ikomeye yo mu bumanuko bwa Nigeria. Ruca mu turere two mu majyepfo y'igihugu, rukagira uruhara runini mu gutanga amazi, guteza imbere ubuhinzi, uburovyi n'ubwikorezi bwo mu mazi. Uru ruzi rwinjira mu Imo River estuary, amaherezo amazi yarwo agasohokera mu Nyanja Atlantika.",
        "Rufasha kubungabunga ibidukikije n'ibinyabuzima.",
        "Rutanga amazi yo kunywa no kuvomera indimo.",
        "Uruzi rwa Casamance ruvira mu misozi mito yo mu bumanuko bwa Senegal. Rutembera rugana mu burengero, ruca mu karere kazwi cane ka Casamance, ahari amashyamba, ibibaya n’imirima myinshi.",
        "Amashyamba ya mangrove n'ibindi bidukikije.",
        "Uruzi rwa Ankobra ni rumwe mu migezi y'ingenzi yo mu burengerazuba bwa Ghana. Rufise uruhara runini mu buzima bw'abaturage, ubuhinzi, uburovyi n'ubutunzi bw'igihugu. Kubungabunga uru ruzi no kururinda kwanduzwa ni ngombwa kugira ngo rukomeze gutanga amazi n'iterambere ku bisekuru bizokurikira.",
        "Isoko (source): Imisozi yo mu buraruko bushira ubuseruko bwa Nigeria (hafi ya Taraba/Benue uplands)",
        "ni rumwe mu migezi ikomeye yo mu gihugu ca . Ruzwi cane kuko ruhuza ibiyaga bibiri bikomeye: na (biciye mu bibaya n’ishami ry’uruzi), kandi rufise uruhara runini mu bidukikije n’ubuhinzi.",
        "rugaburira ibishanga vya Lake Victoria basin",
        "ibimera vyo mu bishanga (papyrus n’ibindi)",
        "rufasha kubika ubutare n’amasimu (sediments)",
        "ibigori mu karere ka Trans Nzoia (Kenya’s “breadbasket”)",
        "gukoresha amazi menshi mu irrigation ya Mwea",
        "Ruaha ruvira mu misozi ya Kipengere na Mbeya Highlands, ahantu hagwa imvura nyinshi. Rutembera rugana mu kibaya ca Tanzania yo hagati, ruca mu bice vyumye n’ibihe bihindagurika.",
        "ni uruzi ruto ariko rufise akamaro kanini mu majyepfo ya Tanzania, cyane cane mu buhinzi bw’umuceri n’ubuzima bw’abaturage bo muri Kyela. Rufasha kandi mu kugaburira no kubungabunga ibidukikije.",
        "(Luegele) ni uruzi runini rufise uruhara rukomeye mu majyepfo ya Tanzania, kuko rugaburira sisitemu ya kandi rugafasha mu kubungabunga imwe mu ecosystems zikomeye muri Afurika y’Ubuseruko.",
        "gushigikira ibimera byo ku nkengero z’imigezi",
        "rujyana amazi mu bishanga bigaburira Lake Victoria",
        "ni rumwe mu migezi y'ingenzi yo mu burasirazuba bwa Tanzania. Rufise uruhara rukomeye mu gutanga amazi, guteza imbere ubuhinzi n'ubworozi, no kubungabunga ibinyabuzima mbere y'uko rusohokera mu Nyanja y'Ubuhindi.",
        "ni kimwe mu biyaga bihambaye vya Tanzania. Naho kitamenyekanye nk'ibindi biyaga vya Afurika y'Ubuseruko, gifise uruhara runini mu burovyi, ubuhinzi, ubworozi no kubungabunga ibinyabuzima. Kubera ko kitagira uruzi rusohokamwo, ubunini n'uburebure bw'amazi yaco burahindagurika bivanye n'imvura n'ihindagurika ry'ibihe."
    ]
}
